WEBVTT

00:00:22.012 --> 00:00:23.981
[soft music playing]

00:00:46.703 --> 00:00:48.071
[skittering]

00:00:48.071 --> 00:00:51.241
ZOUKEN: Surely you
know the truth,

00:00:51.241 --> 00:00:54.611
who's responsible
for Shinji's death.

00:00:59.349 --> 00:01:00.617
Yes.

00:01:00.617 --> 00:01:05.522
You're finally finished
pretending you can't see.

00:01:05.522 --> 00:01:09.092
After all it endured to grow,
breaking it down

00:01:09.092 --> 00:01:12.496
proved more troublesome
than I expected.

00:01:12.496 --> 00:01:15.532
In a perfect world,
you would have done it

00:01:15.532 --> 00:01:18.435
by personally betraying Sakura,

00:01:18.435 --> 00:01:21.338
but it pays
to have a backup plan.

00:01:21.338 --> 00:01:24.074
- Backup plan? He's dead.

00:01:24.074 --> 00:01:28.345
- It's a half-assed awakening
that retains its humanoid form.

00:01:28.345 --> 00:01:29.813
Though this is quite possibly

00:01:29.813 --> 00:01:33.183
the first time
she has been worthy of praise.

00:01:33.183 --> 00:01:34.551
- [gasps]

00:01:34.551 --> 00:01:36.219
[shudders]

00:01:36.219 --> 00:01:38.655
Zouken, where is Sakura?

00:01:39.723 --> 00:01:42.359
- [chuckles]

00:01:44.728 --> 00:01:48.698
- Hey, what does it feel like,
being a sister?

00:01:56.773 --> 00:01:58.175
[sighs]

00:02:07.717 --> 00:02:09.252
[gasps]

00:02:09.252 --> 00:02:12.789
ZOUKEN: I'm not ungrateful
to you, either.

00:02:12.789 --> 00:02:16.493
Before you,
that girl endured everything,

00:02:16.493 --> 00:02:19.629
but you taught her
how to desire other humans

00:02:19.629 --> 00:02:23.400
and gave her
a reason to fight back.

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.602
Now that she's killed
her older brother,

00:02:25.602 --> 00:02:28.738
she cannot stand still
any longer.

00:02:28.738 --> 00:02:31.108
Next, she will claim
Archer's soul

00:02:31.108 --> 00:02:33.610
from the Einzberns' Holy Grail,

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:36.880
and then she will take
the key to the gate,

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:39.316
and it will all be over.

00:02:39.316 --> 00:02:40.484
- [gasps]

00:02:40.484 --> 00:02:41.618
Zouken!

00:02:41.618 --> 00:02:42.819
[glass shatters]

00:02:43.854 --> 00:02:45.222
- [gasps]

00:02:47.324 --> 00:02:48.291
- [gasps]

00:02:51.761 --> 00:02:55.165
- [laughs]

00:02:57.601 --> 00:03:02.606
ZOUKEN: Now, Sakura, you shall
finally accept the shadow.

00:03:08.311 --> 00:03:10.881
SAKURA:
As you wish, Grandfather.

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:22.192
- [grunts]

00:03:22.192 --> 00:03:23.927
ILLYA: Sakura.

00:03:33.803 --> 00:03:35.172
[energy crackles]

00:03:38.475 --> 00:03:42.445
SAKURA: Ah, I wondered
if you'd be here, Big Sister.

00:03:42.445 --> 00:03:46.249
RIN: Of course.
I'm not like Shirou, you know.

00:03:46.249 --> 00:03:48.251
I wouldn't run off to save you.

00:03:48.251 --> 00:03:50.520
And I knew you'd be back.

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:53.190
You were going to come back
for Illya sooner or later.

00:03:54.658 --> 00:03:57.327
- You're so mean, Big Sister.

00:03:57.327 --> 00:04:01.198
Honestly, am I
that bad of a person?

00:04:01.198 --> 00:04:02.966
- Of course you are.

00:04:02.966 --> 00:04:06.836
to trust the one person
who swore to protect you,

00:04:06.836 --> 00:04:09.673
so you ran away
without a word like a coward.

00:04:09.673 --> 00:04:10.874
- [gasps]

00:04:10.874 --> 00:04:11.875
[sighs]

00:04:11.875 --> 00:04:13.376
You're right.

00:04:14.444 --> 00:04:16.646
That's the person
I've always been.

00:04:17.681 --> 00:04:19.316
- But that's all over.
- [gasps]

00:04:19.316 --> 00:04:20.884
I'm not weak anymore.

00:04:20.884 --> 00:04:21.985
[crystals clink]

00:04:21.985 --> 00:04:24.921
From here on,
I'll protect Shirou.

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:27.857
- SAKURA: I'm strong.
- [sighs]

00:04:27.857 --> 00:04:31.394
Nothing can stop me,
not even you.

00:04:31.394 --> 00:04:33.830
- [woman vocalizing]
- [gasps]

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.899
Verschmelzen!

00:04:37.634 --> 00:04:39.636
- I wouldn't do that.

00:04:42.505 --> 00:04:44.908
If you use
that kind of Magecraft,

00:04:44.908 --> 00:04:48.278
you'll cause the whole house
to fall apart.

00:04:50.413 --> 00:04:51.781
[vocalizing continues]

00:04:56.586 --> 00:04:58.655
- [gags]

00:04:58.655 --> 00:05:00.624
[shuddering]

00:05:02.025 --> 00:05:03.994
[Sakura laughing]

00:05:06.596 --> 00:05:08.465
Delicious.

00:05:08.465 --> 00:05:11.534
Your magical energy's wonderful,
Big Sister.

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:14.604
Except...

00:05:14.604 --> 00:05:18.341
it's not enough, not yet.

00:05:19.409 --> 00:05:21.378
If I don't finish you,

00:05:21.378 --> 00:05:22.746
you'll get back up.

00:05:23.813 --> 00:05:27.017
Because you're a hero.

00:05:27.017 --> 00:05:28.952
I have no choice.

00:05:35.592 --> 00:05:36.559
[gasps]

00:05:38.361 --> 00:05:40.563
- [panting]

00:05:40.563 --> 00:05:42.065
Sakura!

00:05:44.668 --> 00:05:46.336
- Shirou...

00:05:46.336 --> 00:05:47.370
why?

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:48.571
- [gasps]

00:05:50.674 --> 00:05:51.675
Sa...

00:05:51.675 --> 00:05:53.943
[gasps]

00:05:53.943 --> 00:05:55.312
[Rin shuddering]

00:05:55.312 --> 00:05:56.579
- Tohsaka!

00:05:57.881 --> 00:05:59.516
[Shirou gasps]

00:05:59.516 --> 00:06:01.051
What is this?

00:06:01.051 --> 00:06:02.652
[grunts]

00:06:02.652 --> 00:06:05.622
[winces]

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:10.060
SAKURA: Why are you rushing
to protect my sister...

00:06:11.661 --> 00:06:13.897
without saying a word to me?

00:06:14.931 --> 00:06:17.567
Why aren't you scolding me?

00:06:17.567 --> 00:06:22.072
You saw what happened
to my brother, what I did.

00:06:22.072 --> 00:06:23.573
- You're wrong.

00:06:23.573 --> 00:06:25.041
Zouken set you up. It wasn't--

00:06:25.041 --> 00:06:26.743
- I killed him.

00:06:26.743 --> 00:06:29.379
- You see, Shirou, I'm crazy.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:33.883
In fact, I have been
since the very beginning.

00:06:34.918 --> 00:06:36.653
- Sakura.

00:06:37.754 --> 00:06:40.590
- Isn't it painful
to be with me?

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:41.958
Isn't it, Shirou?

00:06:41.958 --> 00:06:45.895
That's why I had no choice
but to get far away from you.

00:06:45.895 --> 00:06:48.598
But that doesn't work for me,

00:06:48.598 --> 00:06:51.034
'cause you're the only thing
that makes me happy.

00:06:51.034 --> 00:06:52.969
I can't live without you.

00:06:52.969 --> 00:06:56.373
And you can't distance yourself
from me, either,

00:06:56.373 --> 00:06:58.141
because you
can't betray yourself

00:06:58.141 --> 00:07:00.009
any more than you already have.

00:07:08.051 --> 00:07:10.854
Which is why
I have to kill you.

00:07:11.955 --> 00:07:13.990
Your suffering will end,

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:16.393
and you'll be
by my side forever.

00:07:20.530 --> 00:07:21.931
[gasps]

00:07:25.869 --> 00:07:29.706
RIDER: This was the last order
you gave me, Sakura,

00:07:29.706 --> 00:07:33.977
"Protect Shirou,
no matter the circumstances."

00:07:35.111 --> 00:07:38.681
- Think you can stop me?
Bad girl.

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:42.051
- [gasps]

00:07:42.051 --> 00:07:45.989
RIDER: Sakura,
don't follow this path.

00:07:45.989 --> 00:07:48.024
You'll find nothing at the end,

00:07:48.024 --> 00:07:51.795
nothing but darkness,
and you'll be all alone.

00:07:53.029 --> 00:07:55.732
But I'm here. Follow me,

00:07:55.732 --> 00:07:57.901
and I'll guide you
back to the light.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:01.638
- [gasps]

00:08:01.638 --> 00:08:03.540
[squelch]

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:04.574
- [sighs]

00:08:08.578 --> 00:08:09.579
[groans]

00:08:13.483 --> 00:08:15.518
[gasping]

00:08:15.518 --> 00:08:17.754
Sakura...

00:08:20.523 --> 00:08:23.059
[groans]

00:08:24.828 --> 00:08:27.664
SABER: You serve no Master now.

00:08:32.769 --> 00:08:35.772
SAKURA: Rider,
I'm going to absorb you.

00:08:35.772 --> 00:08:37.841
- [shudders] No, don't!

00:08:37.841 --> 00:08:39.776
- I have all the power I need,

00:08:39.776 --> 00:08:42.979
but I'll make an exception
and put you to use like Saber.

00:08:48.084 --> 00:08:50.753
- Stop it, Sakura.
That's enough.

00:08:53.089 --> 00:08:55.191
You can take me with you.

00:08:55.191 --> 00:08:56.693
- Illya!

00:08:56.693 --> 00:08:59.796
- Have you lost your mind?

00:08:59.796 --> 00:09:03.132
You realize if you come with me,
that I will kill you.

00:09:03.132 --> 00:09:06.503
- But it's useless to resist.

00:09:06.503 --> 00:09:09.272
I mean, you're too powerful
for anyone to stop you.

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:11.975
- [gasps]

00:09:11.975 --> 00:09:13.843
I'm too...

00:09:13.843 --> 00:09:15.211
powerful?

00:09:19.282 --> 00:09:20.817
[gasps]

00:09:21.985 --> 00:09:24.654
- You want the last key,
but it's not here.

00:09:24.654 --> 00:09:26.189
I'm afraid
you'll have to come back

00:09:26.189 --> 00:09:28.691
to my castle with me
to get it.

00:09:28.691 --> 00:09:31.594
That's the only way
you can open the gate.

00:09:33.096 --> 00:09:34.531
- All right, then.

00:09:34.531 --> 00:09:37.200
Whatever you're planning,
I'll play along.

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:46.142
- [gasping]

00:09:48.945 --> 00:09:52.015
- Shirou, please don't
let me see you again.

00:09:53.149 --> 00:09:55.251
I'll have no choice
but to kill you.

00:09:58.121 --> 00:09:59.956
ILLYA: It's over.

00:09:59.956 --> 00:10:02.825
I've had a lot of fun,
Big Brother.

00:10:02.825 --> 00:10:04.594
Goodbye now.

00:10:04.594 --> 00:10:05.562
- [grunts]

00:10:15.071 --> 00:10:16.573
[sighs]

00:10:17.607 --> 00:10:19.108
[gasps] Please, Saber.

00:10:19.108 --> 00:10:23.279
- What do you think
you're going to do?

00:10:23.279 --> 00:10:25.715
Sakura will claim
the Holy Grail

00:10:25.715 --> 00:10:27.750
one way or another.

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:30.987
Even if she has to die
in order to do it,

00:10:30.987 --> 00:10:34.057
Sakura Matou
will find salvation.

00:10:36.626 --> 00:10:38.294
This is your last warning.

00:10:38.294 --> 00:10:42.098
If you're still stubborn enough
to try to follow us,

00:10:42.098 --> 00:10:44.300
I will cut off your head.

00:10:48.304 --> 00:10:50.273
[wind blowing]

00:10:56.913 --> 00:10:58.881
- [shuddering]

00:11:00.650 --> 00:11:02.185
[grunts]

00:11:02.185 --> 00:11:04.153
[stifling sobs]

00:11:08.625 --> 00:11:09.392
[grunts]

00:11:12.328 --> 00:11:15.365
KIREI: The outcome
has been decided.

00:11:16.399 --> 00:11:19.902
[woman singing
in foreign language]

00:11:19.902 --> 00:11:24.007
Actually, I suppose it's been
decided for a long time now.

00:11:25.074 --> 00:11:28.311
This Holy Grail War was altered.

00:11:28.311 --> 00:11:30.913
There should only be
one Holy Grail.

00:11:31.948 --> 00:11:33.416
But in this place,

00:11:33.416 --> 00:11:35.985
a second Grail
has already existed.

00:11:35.985 --> 00:11:40.156
Its vessel was deemed fit to
hold the contents of the Grail,

00:11:40.156 --> 00:11:42.925
and thus it became one itself.

00:11:44.394 --> 00:11:46.295
If that vessel
had been unworthy,

00:11:46.295 --> 00:11:48.131
surely it would have
become nothing more

00:11:48.131 --> 00:11:49.966
than a mound of flesh.

00:11:51.401 --> 00:11:53.770
But the stage is now set,

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:56.305
and soon I will have my answer.

00:11:56.305 --> 00:11:59.108
The birth will reveal it to me.

00:12:02.445 --> 00:12:07.150
that simply can't be seen
from the audience...

00:12:08.685 --> 00:12:13.189
well, then, I shall rise
onto the stage myself.

00:12:18.695 --> 00:12:20.463
- Kotomine!

00:12:20.463 --> 00:12:22.865
It's Tohsaka.

00:12:22.865 --> 00:12:23.966
Help her.

00:12:26.903 --> 00:12:28.271
[singing continues]

00:12:28.271 --> 00:12:29.706
- [chuckles]

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:33.376
[heart beating]

00:12:44.854 --> 00:12:46.289
[flowing]

00:12:46.289 --> 00:12:48.257
[heartbeat
and singing continue]

00:12:53.296 --> 00:12:54.263
[heartbeat stops]

00:13:05.007 --> 00:13:06.342
[singing ends]

00:13:06.342 --> 00:13:08.878
[wind blowing]

00:13:13.116 --> 00:13:15.017
- [sighs]

00:13:15.017 --> 00:13:16.018
[gasps]

00:13:16.018 --> 00:13:17.453
[groans]

00:13:17.453 --> 00:13:19.388
- You're awake.

00:13:19.388 --> 00:13:21.491
Is it difficult to move?

00:13:21.491 --> 00:13:22.925
- [sighs]

00:13:22.925 --> 00:13:25.928
Kotomine.

00:13:25.928 --> 00:13:28.197
[gasps] Where's Tohsaka?

00:13:28.197 --> 00:13:29.932
- Hmm.

00:13:29.932 --> 00:13:33.803
She had been drained
of all her magical energy.

00:13:33.803 --> 00:13:35.905
She'll be fine by tomorrow.

00:13:35.905 --> 00:13:37.540
I buried her.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.809
- Uh...

00:13:39.809 --> 00:13:41.043
buried?

00:13:41.043 --> 00:13:43.279
- In the yard
on the Tohsaka estate.

00:13:43.279 --> 00:13:45.248
The soil there is special.

00:13:46.916 --> 00:13:48.317
- Oh, okay.

00:13:48.317 --> 00:13:50.787
Thanks for the help,

00:13:50.787 --> 00:13:52.288
but I gotta get going.

00:13:53.489 --> 00:13:56.025
- Care to tell me
where you're headed?

00:13:57.059 --> 00:13:58.461
- [inhales]

00:13:58.461 --> 00:14:01.097
Illya let Sakura take her.

00:14:01.097 --> 00:14:03.166
We'd be dead if she hadn't.

00:14:03.166 --> 00:14:04.267
But now--

00:14:04.267 --> 00:14:05.434
- I take that to mean

00:14:05.434 --> 00:14:09.172
that Sakura Matou
has become your enemy.

00:14:13.876 --> 00:14:15.845
[footsteps echoing]

00:14:19.982 --> 00:14:21.117
Come with me.

00:14:24.587 --> 00:14:28.224
I suspect Zouken's objective
is to possess Sakura

00:14:28.224 --> 00:14:30.893
once she becomes
nothing but a hollow shell.

00:14:30.893 --> 00:14:35.932
- Therefore, if we're going
to stop that from happening,

00:14:35.932 --> 00:14:38.134
we must rescue Illyasviel

00:14:38.134 --> 00:14:41.838
and defeat Zouken
before it's too late.

00:14:41.838 --> 00:14:43.139
At least for the time being,

00:14:43.139 --> 00:14:46.075
you and I
have that objective in common.

00:14:46.075 --> 00:14:48.144
- [gasps] What are you saying?

00:14:50.613 --> 00:14:51.581
[gasps]

00:14:55.518 --> 00:14:57.386
- I'm saying I'll help.

00:14:57.386 --> 00:14:59.388
Now let's get going.

00:15:05.194 --> 00:15:08.397
- Wait a second.
What about Rider?

00:15:08.397 --> 00:15:10.466
- Out of the question.

00:15:10.466 --> 00:15:13.169
Even without Command Spells,
they're still connected.

00:15:13.169 --> 00:15:17.506
We'll have no chance if Sakura
catches on before we get there.

00:15:17.506 --> 00:15:18.908
- [sighs]

00:15:24.881 --> 00:15:26.582
[wind blowing]

00:15:32.054 --> 00:15:34.090
REPORTER: ...two nights since
the mysterious disappearances

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:35.892
in Fuyuki City.

00:15:35.892 --> 00:15:37.193
The total number
of missing persons

00:15:37.193 --> 00:15:39.295
is still unknown,
as is the cause.

00:15:39.295 --> 00:15:41.931
A power outage
that coincided with the event,

00:15:41.931 --> 00:15:44.133
lasting several hours
appears to have been centered

00:15:44.133 --> 00:15:46.168
- around the New City train--
- [clicks radio off]

00:15:46.168 --> 00:15:48.371
- You know, if it were him,

00:15:48.371 --> 00:15:50.439
he wouldn't have
let Sakura live long enough

00:15:50.439 --> 00:15:52.141
for any of this to happen.

00:15:55.077 --> 00:15:57.113
For the sake of "justice,"

00:15:57.113 --> 00:15:59.582
your father felt
he needed to detach himself

00:15:59.582 --> 00:16:01.984
from all of his
emotional entanglements.

00:16:03.119 --> 00:16:06.255
I disliked Kiritsugu Emiya's
way of life.

00:16:06.255 --> 00:16:08.591
It was difficult to witness.

00:16:08.591 --> 00:16:11.961
He abandoned everything he had
since the very beginning,

00:16:11.961 --> 00:16:13.529
while I never had anything

00:16:13.529 --> 00:16:16.265
that would have been
worthy of sacrifice.

00:16:16.265 --> 00:16:18.301
It's all the same in the end,

00:16:18.301 --> 00:16:21.637
but the path we took
to get there made a difference.

00:16:21.637 --> 00:16:25.675
We were so similar,
and yet I despised him.

00:16:25.675 --> 00:16:27.710
If you're going
to throw it away,

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:30.446
why bother with it
in the first place?

00:16:30.446 --> 00:16:32.949
But he kept trying
to hold on to it.

00:16:33.983 --> 00:16:35.384
Even after discarding it,

00:16:35.384 --> 00:16:37.086
he picked it back up.

00:16:38.154 --> 00:16:42.091
But truly,
your father knew happiness.

00:16:43.459 --> 00:16:46.495
- Kiritsugu was happy?

00:16:46.495 --> 00:16:48.130
- Love yourself.

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:49.665
Love your neighbors.

00:16:49.665 --> 00:16:51.067
Forgive sins.

00:16:51.067 --> 00:16:52.668
Accept punishment.

00:16:52.668 --> 00:16:56.005
All the nourishment
a life needs.

00:16:56.005 --> 00:17:01.410
The things people of your ilk
call "happiness,"

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:03.980
they never brought me any joy.

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:05.715
That's all I can tell you.

00:17:12.588 --> 00:17:14.256
- Then I have a question.

00:17:14.256 --> 00:17:16.125
Why did you save Sakura?

00:17:17.159 --> 00:17:20.096
- Humans are meant to die,

00:17:20.096 --> 00:17:23.132
but she wasn't the only thing
that was dying.

00:17:23.132 --> 00:17:26.635
Otherwise, I wouldn't have done
nearly so much to intervene.

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:31.073
However, it is my role
to bless the birth

00:17:31.073 --> 00:17:34.477
of the darkness
inside of Sakura Matou.

00:17:34.477 --> 00:17:37.079
- Are you insane?

00:17:37.079 --> 00:17:40.282
That shadow thing,
it kills people.

00:17:40.282 --> 00:17:44.353
- And yet it still
hasn't been born.

00:17:44.353 --> 00:17:47.023
Were that the case,
it would be assigned sins

00:17:47.023 --> 00:17:49.325
and punished for them
accordingly.

00:17:49.325 --> 00:17:52.094
But it still deserves a birth.

00:17:52.094 --> 00:17:54.563
Or perhaps you believe
the son of a criminal

00:17:54.563 --> 00:17:58.034
is also a criminal
before ever leaving the womb

00:17:58.034 --> 00:18:01.037
and must therefore be aborted?

00:18:01.037 --> 00:18:02.638
- [sighs]

00:18:08.277 --> 00:18:10.679
- Let me pose you this question.

00:18:12.081 --> 00:18:14.617
When it comes to Sakura,

00:18:14.617 --> 00:18:18.354
you can't deny that she's
quite literally a man-eater.

00:18:19.789 --> 00:18:24.593
Now that you know that,
do you still intend to help her?

00:18:24.593 --> 00:18:26.562
[wind gusting]

00:18:30.332 --> 00:18:34.437
Countless people
have lost their lives to her.

00:18:34.437 --> 00:18:38.074
Even she must be ashamed
of what she has become.

00:18:38.074 --> 00:18:40.543
Wouldn't it be fair
to assume, then,

00:18:40.543 --> 00:18:44.246
that she would
be happier in death?

00:18:44.246 --> 00:18:46.115
It would also
grant her atonement

00:18:46.115 --> 00:18:48.184
for the lives she's taken.

00:18:49.718 --> 00:18:53.722
- No, that doesn't
make things better.

00:18:55.424 --> 00:18:56.392
- Doesn't it?

00:18:57.526 --> 00:19:00.162
I suppose that means
you won't be following

00:19:00.162 --> 00:19:02.865
in Kiritsugu Emiya's
footsteps, then.

00:19:04.733 --> 00:19:07.636
[wind gusting]

00:19:07.636 --> 00:19:09.338
- [inhales]

00:19:10.372 --> 00:19:11.340
[grunts]

00:19:13.142 --> 00:19:15.111
[music playing]

00:19:35.431 --> 00:19:36.565
I'll check it out.

00:19:41.403 --> 00:19:42.438
[exhales]

00:19:43.906 --> 00:19:47.376
Beginning synchronization.

00:19:47.376 --> 00:19:51.313
Tracing basic structure.

00:19:51.313 --> 00:19:54.850
Tracing component materials.

00:19:58.587 --> 00:20:00.389
On the third floor...

00:20:00.389 --> 00:20:02.625
in the room on the left.

00:20:07.163 --> 00:20:08.197
- [gasps]

00:20:08.197 --> 00:20:10.266
- [wincing]

00:20:11.433 --> 00:20:12.535
Sakura.

00:20:14.570 --> 00:20:15.771
- That's enough.

00:20:15.771 --> 00:20:19.241
Don't lose sight
of your priorities here.

00:20:21.443 --> 00:20:23.345
- Yeah, I know.

00:20:23.345 --> 00:20:25.648
- Well then, Shirou Emiya...

00:20:25.648 --> 00:20:30.586
- do you have any experience
with mountain climbing?

00:20:37.760 --> 00:20:40.696
- Miss Illya, are we really
going to be fully preparing

00:20:40.696 --> 00:20:42.932
your formal attire
for these people?

00:20:42.932 --> 00:20:44.633
ILLYA: Did you forget?

00:20:44.633 --> 00:20:46.635
We only have one purpose,

00:20:46.635 --> 00:20:49.705
to make sure
the Holy Grail is completed.

00:20:49.705 --> 00:20:52.374
As long as it's suitable,

00:20:52.374 --> 00:20:54.977
the vessel
doesn't have to be me.

00:20:54.977 --> 00:20:56.679
BOTH: Hmm?

00:20:56.679 --> 00:20:58.314
[both sigh]

00:21:03.219 --> 00:21:04.987
[wind blowing]

00:21:20.469 --> 00:21:21.437
- [sighs]

00:21:23.539 --> 00:21:24.607
[gasps]

00:21:26.642 --> 00:21:29.545
- [groans]

00:21:29.545 --> 00:21:30.546
- [gasping]

00:21:30.546 --> 00:21:32.748
[Shirou groans]

00:21:32.748 --> 00:21:35.784
Did you really have
to throw me at the window?

00:21:35.784 --> 00:21:40.656
You looked pathetic plastered
to the wall with one arm.

00:21:40.656 --> 00:21:42.591
I thought
I'd speed things up a bit.

00:21:42.591 --> 00:21:43.692
We don't have all night.

00:21:43.692 --> 00:21:45.861
- What are you doing here?
Who are you?!

00:21:45.861 --> 00:21:47.429
- Are you thieves?

00:21:47.429 --> 00:21:50.432
- Oh, no, not at all!
We're not bad guys!

00:21:51.600 --> 00:21:52.901
- [annoyed] Shirou.

00:21:52.901 --> 00:21:54.003
- [gasps]

00:21:56.639 --> 00:21:58.374
- Illya--
- Why are you here?

00:22:00.276 --> 00:22:02.311
You need to go home.

00:22:02.311 --> 00:22:04.947
There's nothing left
for you to do now.

00:22:05.981 --> 00:22:07.816
Just forget about Sakura,

00:22:07.816 --> 00:22:09.885
and leave everything to me.

00:22:10.919 --> 00:22:12.554
Go on.

00:22:12.554 --> 00:22:14.890
This is my burden to bear.

00:22:17.459 --> 00:22:19.528
SHIROU: So stupid.

00:22:19.528 --> 00:22:21.497
[footsteps echoing]

00:22:26.368 --> 00:22:27.636
- What is it?

00:22:28.671 --> 00:22:30.739
- That doesn't matter.
- [gasps]

00:22:30.739 --> 00:22:33.342
- [inhales]

00:22:33.342 --> 00:22:35.778
I don't care what you think
your burden is!

00:22:35.778 --> 00:22:37.646
You can try to act all tough,

00:22:37.646 --> 00:22:39.748
you can try to pretend
you're all right,

00:22:39.748 --> 00:22:41.750
but I won't be fooled
by any of that!

00:22:41.750 --> 00:22:43.085
- [gasps]

00:22:43.085 --> 00:22:45.020
I'm not trying to act tough!

00:22:45.020 --> 00:22:46.755
I'm the Holy Grail, you dummy!

00:22:46.755 --> 00:22:48.757
- That is exactly
what I'm talking about!

00:22:48.757 --> 00:22:50.459
You are Illya!

00:22:50.459 --> 00:22:52.027
- [gasps]

00:22:52.027 --> 00:22:54.863
- So don't sacrifice yourself,

00:22:54.863 --> 00:22:56.965
not for the sake
of someone else!

00:22:56.965 --> 00:22:58.534
- [gasps]

00:22:58.534 --> 00:22:59.835
You say that,

00:22:59.835 --> 00:23:01.537
but look who's talking.

00:23:03.339 --> 00:23:05.474
[sighing]

00:23:05.474 --> 00:23:07.109
Huh?

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:12.881
- Let's go.

00:23:15.584 --> 00:23:17.953
- [sighs]

00:23:17.953 --> 00:23:19.755
[thinking] I can't do this.

00:23:19.755 --> 00:23:22.725
I know it will never work

00:23:25.060 --> 00:23:26.362
[sighs]

00:23:26.362 --> 00:23:27.529
[yelps]

00:23:27.529 --> 00:23:30.132
- As I said before,
we don't have all night.

00:23:30.132 --> 00:23:32.401
- Hold on! Stop! Put me down!

00:23:32.401 --> 00:23:34.903
- Uh, shouldn't we...

00:23:34.903 --> 00:23:37.039
- This castle
is where we belong.

00:23:37.039 --> 00:23:38.941
Don't worry about us.

00:23:38.941 --> 00:23:40.943
- We entrust Illya to you.

00:23:43.445 --> 00:23:44.413
- [grunts]

00:23:46.682 --> 00:23:48.083
[wincing]

00:23:49.518 --> 00:23:50.619
- You okay?

00:23:51.653 --> 00:23:53.589
- You always surprise me.

00:23:53.589 --> 00:23:56.992
Jumping from the third story
without using Magecraft.

00:23:56.992 --> 00:23:58.660
Are you suicidal?

00:23:58.660 --> 00:23:59.728
- Give me a break!

00:23:59.728 --> 00:24:02.698
I thought I'd be
able to pull it off.

00:24:02.698 --> 00:24:03.832
[gasps]

00:24:03.832 --> 00:24:05.167
Um...

00:24:05.167 --> 00:24:08.070
- Archer is influencing
your mind.

00:24:08.070 --> 00:24:09.638
- [sighs]

00:24:14.576 --> 00:24:16.578
- You came for me after all.

00:24:17.613 --> 00:24:18.781
Shirou.

00:24:20.649 --> 00:24:22.618
[flowing]

00:24:30.959 --> 00:24:33.962
- [roars]

00:24:34.997 --> 00:24:37.866
[both gasp]

00:24:37.866 --> 00:24:38.834
- Let's move.

00:24:40.102 --> 00:24:41.970
[chorus vocalizing]

00:24:43.172 --> 00:24:45.541
[energetic music playing]

00:24:48.043 --> 00:24:49.445
SHIROHe's fast.

00:24:50.913 --> 00:24:53.682
But I can keep up.

00:24:55.150 --> 00:24:58.554
[Berserker roars]

00:24:59.721 --> 00:25:00.956
- Berserker.

00:25:00.956 --> 00:25:01.924
- Huh?

00:25:06.562 --> 00:25:07.563
- [chuckles]

00:25:13.235 --> 00:25:16.638
[Hassan yells]

00:25:16.638 --> 00:25:17.906
- [gasps]

00:25:25.948 --> 00:25:28.917
[bells ring]

00:25:36.925 --> 00:25:37.893
- [grunts]

00:25:41.096 --> 00:25:42.064
[blade thunks]

00:25:43.932 --> 00:25:45.133
[sighs]

00:25:46.168 --> 00:25:47.169
- [scoffs]

00:25:47.169 --> 00:25:49.037
I guess I was wrong about you.

00:25:49.037 --> 00:25:50.973
You're not just a doll.

00:25:50.973 --> 00:25:52.007
- [scoffs]

00:25:55.978 --> 00:25:57.546
- Take her and go.

00:25:57.546 --> 00:25:58.614
- [gasps]

00:26:00.749 --> 00:26:01.884
- Emiya...

00:26:01.884 --> 00:26:03.785
if you decide to rescue a woman,

00:26:03.785 --> 00:26:05.854
be sure not to kill her.

00:26:05.854 --> 00:26:08.891
Seeing her die before your eyes,

00:26:08.891 --> 00:26:11.293
it'll haunt you
for the rest of your life.

00:26:14.730 --> 00:26:16.899
- [sighs]
- [Berserker growls]

00:26:16.899 --> 00:26:18.700
- Okay, let's go.

00:26:28.610 --> 00:26:31.313
- The White Holy Grail
will not escape.

00:26:31.313 --> 00:26:36.084
I need her. I have a wish
for it to grant as well.

00:26:37.185 --> 00:26:39.154
- [panting]

00:26:40.889 --> 00:26:41.924
[gasps]

00:26:41.924 --> 00:26:43.625
- [growls]

00:26:47.629 --> 00:26:49.665
- Is he looking for me?

00:26:54.069 --> 00:26:56.038
- [roars]

00:26:59.207 --> 00:27:00.576
- [sighs]

00:27:00.576 --> 00:27:02.044
- Shirou...

00:27:02.044 --> 00:27:04.079
you have to leave me.

00:27:04.079 --> 00:27:06.014
- Huh? I can't do that!

00:27:06.014 --> 00:27:07.349
- [rumbling]
- [gasps]

00:27:08.884 --> 00:27:10.852
[rumbling echoing]

00:27:19.227 --> 00:27:20.295
[rumbling fades]

00:27:20.295 --> 00:27:21.730
- Hmm?

00:27:23.765 --> 00:27:25.667
[door creaks]

00:27:25.667 --> 00:27:28.136
[footsteps echoing]

00:27:36.144 --> 00:27:40.616
- What a pleasure
to see you again, Kirei.

00:27:40.616 --> 00:27:43.118
- Zouken Matou.

00:27:43.118 --> 00:27:45.787
Well...

00:27:45.787 --> 00:27:48.123
I wasn't expecting you
to show up.

00:27:49.791 --> 00:27:51.727
- You're finished.

00:27:51.727 --> 00:27:56.131
Do me a favor, and show him
some mercy, Assassin.

00:28:02.137 --> 00:28:04.206
[introspective music playing]

00:28:04.206 --> 00:28:07.009
KIREI: It's strange
that I'm reminded of it now,

00:28:07.009 --> 00:28:11.013
but since the moment
I was born, I've had a flaw.

00:28:11.013 --> 00:28:14.816
For I have always found
happiness in agony.

00:28:14.816 --> 00:28:17.886
Despair is what
gives me pleasure.

00:28:17.886 --> 00:28:19.755
I know what that makes me.

00:28:19.755 --> 00:28:22.824
Any creature that lives
their life in that manner

00:28:22.824 --> 00:28:26.228
is the very definition
of evil.

00:28:26.228 --> 00:28:28.930
It's a terrible flaw.

00:28:28.930 --> 00:28:32.901
But even though I knew I was
a heretic, I had common sense.

00:28:34.970 --> 00:28:36.405
I wanted to change

00:28:36.405 --> 00:28:39.207
and did everything I could
to accomplish it.

00:28:39.207 --> 00:28:43.111
When nothing worked,
I made one final attempt.

00:28:43.111 --> 00:28:45.147
I fell in love with a woman.

00:28:54.156 --> 00:28:59.294
Or more accurately,
I tried to fall in love.

00:28:59.294 --> 00:29:01.430
We even had a child together.

00:29:02.464 --> 00:29:04.066
But it didn't matter.

00:29:05.934 --> 00:29:10.105
Try as I might,
I never could love you.

00:29:11.139 --> 00:29:14.309
- You're wrong. You love me,

00:29:14.309 --> 00:29:16.878
and I know you always have.

00:29:18.346 --> 00:29:20.749
[chuckles]

00:29:21.817 --> 00:29:23.719
[blade stabs]

00:29:23.719 --> 00:29:25.987
[blade slices]

00:29:25.987 --> 00:29:26.955
- [gasps]

00:29:29.357 --> 00:29:30.959
HASSAN: Noble Phantasm...

00:29:32.828 --> 00:29:34.162
Zabaniya!

00:29:41.470 --> 00:29:43.205
ZOUKEN: It's all over.

00:29:46.007 --> 00:29:47.075
- [laughs]

00:29:49.978 --> 00:29:50.979
Eh?

00:29:50.979 --> 00:29:52.447
Impossible. You bastard!

00:29:54.382 --> 00:29:56.118
[groans]

00:29:58.887 --> 00:30:00.255
[groans]

00:30:00.255 --> 00:30:01.389
[screams]

00:30:06.762 --> 00:30:07.529
- Huh?

00:30:10.098 --> 00:30:11.767
- [chorus vocalizing]
- [groans]

00:30:11.767 --> 00:30:13.335
- Know this.

00:30:15.036 --> 00:30:18.140
I will kill. I will let live.

00:30:18.140 --> 00:30:20.375
I will harm, and I will heal.

00:30:21.510 --> 00:30:25.180
None shall ever be able
to escape my grasp.

00:30:25.180 --> 00:30:26.548
None shall ever be able

00:30:26.548 --> 00:30:29.184
- to escape my sight.
- Damn you. Get off me!

00:30:29.184 --> 00:30:30.986
- Be crushed.

00:30:30.986 --> 00:30:34.356
I welcome all who have grown old
or been defeated.

00:30:34.356 --> 00:30:37.425
Devote yourself to me,
learn from me,

00:30:37.425 --> 00:30:39.795
obey me, and rest.

00:30:39.795 --> 00:30:42.531
Do not forget song,
do not forget prayer,

00:30:42.531 --> 00:30:45.433
and most of all,
do not forget me.

00:30:45.433 --> 00:30:49.404
I am light, and I shall
relieve all your burdens.

00:30:49.404 --> 00:30:52.274
- Aha! Are you going to kill me?

00:30:52.274 --> 00:30:55.076
- Your solace is in my hands.

00:30:55.076 --> 00:30:58.814
I shall pour oil unto your sins,
and I shall mark you.

00:30:58.814 --> 00:31:00.882
For it is only through death

00:31:00.882 --> 00:31:04.920
that one can be granted
the gift of eternal life.

00:31:04.920 --> 00:31:06.454
Beg forgiveness now.

00:31:06.454 --> 00:31:08.323
I, the reincarnation,
shall absolve you.

00:31:08.323 --> 00:31:09.457
- [laughs]

00:31:09.457 --> 00:31:11.126
What will that change, huh?

00:31:11.126 --> 00:31:13.295
There is no salvation in you.

00:31:14.329 --> 00:31:16.298
- Kyrie eleison.

00:31:30.579 --> 00:31:33.215
[wind blowing]

00:31:33.215 --> 00:31:35.483
- Using the holy words
of Scripture

00:31:35.483 --> 00:31:38.353
to attack the spirit itself.

00:31:38.353 --> 00:31:39.321
- [grunts]

00:31:40.555 --> 00:31:42.991
- My lord's only weakness.

00:31:42.991 --> 00:31:44.860
How did you survive?

00:31:46.027 --> 00:31:48.496
You were his natural enemy.

00:31:49.898 --> 00:31:52.167
You were already corrupted,
weren't you?

00:31:52.167 --> 00:31:54.502
- [sighs] Hmm.

00:31:54.502 --> 00:31:56.004
- [scoffs]

00:31:56.004 --> 00:31:58.106
That was my mistake.

00:32:05.180 --> 00:32:06.414
- [sighs]

00:32:10.886 --> 00:32:14.155
CLAUDIA: See? Look at you.

00:32:14.155 --> 00:32:15.490
You're crying.

00:32:17.359 --> 00:32:20.028
KIREI: Don't misunderstand me.

00:32:22.964 --> 00:32:25.967
I won't deny
that I was saddened,

00:32:25.967 --> 00:32:29.237
but it wasn't her death
that caused my tears.

00:32:34.042 --> 00:32:36.544
If she was going to die,

00:32:36.544 --> 00:32:40.015
I wanted to kill her
with my own hands.

00:32:41.549 --> 00:32:43.518
[wind blowing]

00:32:48.523 --> 00:32:49.491
[Illya whimpers]

00:32:51.326 --> 00:32:53.962
[gasps] Shirou?

00:32:53.962 --> 00:32:56.665
- [rumbling]
- Illya, are you all right?

00:32:56.665 --> 00:32:58.700
[sighs] Y-yes.

00:32:58.700 --> 00:33:00.535
[Berserker's growls echoing]

00:33:03.338 --> 00:33:04.572
- [gasps]

00:33:04.572 --> 00:33:06.441
You have to run. Go on.

00:33:06.441 --> 00:33:08.944
I'm the only one
Berserker's after.

00:33:09.978 --> 00:33:11.046
Get out of here!

00:33:11.046 --> 00:33:12.380
[gasps]

00:33:12.380 --> 00:33:14.349
- [sighs]

00:33:14.349 --> 00:33:15.517
- [gasps]

00:33:15.517 --> 00:33:17.452
[wind blowing]

00:33:17.452 --> 00:33:20.588
- A big brother's
gotta protect his sister.

00:33:20.588 --> 00:33:22.490
- [growl echoing]
- You can't...

00:33:22.490 --> 00:33:24.726
- [rumbling]
- It's okay.

00:33:24.726 --> 00:33:27.395
You called me your brother,
so that's what I am.

00:33:27.395 --> 00:33:29.998
I'll protect you.

00:33:29.998 --> 00:33:32.734
Blood or not,
you're my little sister.

00:33:34.369 --> 00:33:35.503
- [sighs]

00:33:38.974 --> 00:33:40.742
[sentimental music playing]

00:33:42.444 --> 00:33:44.045
Shirou...

00:33:44.045 --> 00:33:46.081
you can't use Archer's arm.

00:33:46.081 --> 00:33:47.615
You won't come back!

00:33:47.615 --> 00:33:48.984
- I know.

00:33:51.052 --> 00:33:52.387
- You're going to die.

00:33:52.387 --> 00:33:53.688
- Wrong.

00:33:55.557 --> 00:33:57.692
I'm using it so I stay alive.

00:33:59.594 --> 00:34:01.663
- Why?

00:34:01.663 --> 00:34:05.133
Why do you always put yourself
through so much suffering?!

00:34:05.133 --> 00:34:08.570
You have never done
anything wrong! It's not fair!

00:34:08.570 --> 00:34:09.571
- [gasps]

00:34:11.006 --> 00:34:13.008
[sighs]

00:34:13.008 --> 00:34:14.409
Not true.

00:34:14.409 --> 00:34:18.513
I've done plenty wrong,
no matter what you think.

00:34:18.513 --> 00:34:19.714
But...

00:34:21.349 --> 00:34:22.484
thank you.

00:34:29.391 --> 00:34:31.526
I don't know
what using this arm will do,

00:34:31.526 --> 00:34:33.695
but I have to try.

00:34:33.695 --> 00:34:36.231
It might take away
all my memories,

00:34:36.231 --> 00:34:39.067
the fact that I swore
to protect Sakura

00:34:39.067 --> 00:34:43.271
or why I came here,
to bring Illya back with me.

00:34:43.271 --> 00:34:44.806
Doesn't matter.

00:34:44.806 --> 00:34:47.275
He trusted me with this
for a reason,

00:34:47.275 --> 00:34:49.210
so I'll do what I have to.

00:34:52.280 --> 00:34:53.782
I'm taking him down.

00:34:53.782 --> 00:34:55.116
That okay?

00:34:59.421 --> 00:35:01.723
- [sighs]

00:35:10.165 --> 00:35:12.133
[wind blowing]

00:35:16.438 --> 00:35:17.672
[no audible dialogue]

00:35:19.074 --> 00:35:21.342
SHIROU: My mind
and body crumble,

00:35:21.342 --> 00:35:23.211
and I feel nothing.

00:35:25.647 --> 00:35:28.850
I can't remember why I'm here.

00:35:28.850 --> 00:35:33.455
I can't remember
why this is happening.

00:35:33.455 --> 00:35:36.858
I can't remember
what I'm fighting for.

00:35:36.858 --> 00:35:38.827
[energetic music playing]

00:35:58.580 --> 00:36:00.415
- Think you can keep up?

00:36:10.859 --> 00:36:13.461
- You're asking
if I can keep up?

00:36:13.461 --> 00:36:14.496
What do you mean?!

00:36:15.530 --> 00:36:17.832
You're asking the wrong person!

00:36:27.375 --> 00:36:29.377
You keep up with me!

00:36:43.224 --> 00:36:44.859
- [snarls]

00:36:46.828 --> 00:36:48.730
- Trace on!

00:36:55.570 --> 00:36:57.205
[sentimental music playing]

00:36:59.407 --> 00:37:01.376
[music playing only]

00:37:02.944 --> 00:37:04.312
[magazine clicks]

00:37:10.185 --> 00:37:12.720
Trigger off.

00:37:15.790 --> 00:37:18.226
- [growls]

00:37:26.868 --> 00:37:30.405
- Nine Lives Blade Works!

00:37:38.680 --> 00:37:40.748
- [growls]

00:37:53.461 --> 00:37:55.763
[roars]

00:37:58.866 --> 00:38:03.504
- [yells]

00:38:35.803 --> 00:38:37.905
BERSERKER: Protect her for me.

00:38:37.905 --> 00:38:38.873
- [gasps]

00:38:47.015 --> 00:38:48.616
- [gasps]

00:38:48.616 --> 00:38:50.585
[wind blowing]

00:38:57.859 --> 00:38:59.994
[gasps] Shirou.

00:39:02.030 --> 00:39:03.998
[armor clanking]

00:39:09.671 --> 00:39:10.838
- It's Saber.

00:39:19.480 --> 00:39:21.049
[ominous chord plays]

00:39:21.049 --> 00:39:22.483
- [gasps]

00:39:23.518 --> 00:39:24.886
SAKURA: How does it feel,

00:39:24.886 --> 00:39:28.556
someone clutching your heart
in their grasp?

00:39:29.757 --> 00:39:31.726
- [gasping]

00:39:33.995 --> 00:39:35.830
- Oh, I see.

00:39:35.830 --> 00:39:38.733
It seems you died ten years ago.

00:39:38.733 --> 00:39:41.669
And you only came back
because of--

00:39:41.669 --> 00:39:45.340
Uh, I ate him the other day.

00:39:45.340 --> 00:39:48.943
he was showered with
the contents of the Holy Grail.

00:39:50.345 --> 00:39:52.680
But because he
couldn't be corrupted by it,

00:39:52.680 --> 00:39:55.983
all his dark energy
flowed into you, his Master.

00:39:55.983 --> 00:39:57.485
Isn't that right?

00:39:58.720 --> 00:40:01.956
- Seems you've changed,
Sakura Matou.

00:40:02.990 --> 00:40:05.760
- Yes, I certainly have.

00:40:05.760 --> 00:40:07.762
I've changed a lot.

00:40:07.762 --> 00:40:10.732
I'm not the same Sakura
that I used to be.

00:40:11.799 --> 00:40:13.801
Now she doesn't exist.

00:40:13.801 --> 00:40:15.903
She was far too weak.

00:40:15.903 --> 00:40:17.972
- [gasps]

00:40:17.972 --> 00:40:19.474
Hah.

00:40:19.474 --> 00:40:21.843
You don't need
to hide it from me.

00:40:21.843 --> 00:40:24.746
- What do you mean? Hide what?

00:40:24.746 --> 00:40:27.982
- You're not some kind
of alternate personality.

00:40:27.982 --> 00:40:30.852
The version of you
intoxicated with violence

00:40:30.852 --> 00:40:33.388
is still Sakura Matou.

00:40:33.388 --> 00:40:35.156
- [gasps]

00:40:35.156 --> 00:40:37.725
You're the one
who made me this way, priest.

00:40:37.725 --> 00:40:38.826
- [chuckles]

00:40:38.826 --> 00:40:41.396
I won't deny it.

00:40:41.396 --> 00:40:44.399
I had my own reasons
to keep you alive.

00:40:44.399 --> 00:40:46.134
And just look at you now.

00:40:46.134 --> 00:40:48.469
You've met all my expectations,

00:40:48.469 --> 00:40:51.105
and very soon
the Avenger will be born.

00:40:51.105 --> 00:40:53.775
It was almost easy.

00:40:53.775 --> 00:40:54.909
[heart beats]

00:40:54.909 --> 00:40:56.477
- [gasps]

00:40:56.477 --> 00:40:58.780
It hasn't felt easy at all!

00:40:58.780 --> 00:41:01.115
You have no idea
what I've had to endure,

00:41:01.115 --> 00:41:03.084
the pain that it's caused!

00:41:03.084 --> 00:41:04.552
- No, I don't.

00:41:04.552 --> 00:41:06.087
And I don't need to know.

00:41:06.087 --> 00:41:07.488
- [gasps]

00:41:08.556 --> 00:41:09.724
[grunts]

00:41:09.724 --> 00:41:11.793
[crunching]

00:41:11.793 --> 00:41:13.127
- [gags]

00:41:17.498 --> 00:41:19.467
- [panting]

00:41:22.804 --> 00:41:24.605
[chuckles]

00:41:24.605 --> 00:41:27.108
- [distant roar echoes]
- [gasps]

00:41:27.108 --> 00:41:28.943
[groans]

00:41:28.943 --> 00:41:30.845
[gasping]

00:41:33.047 --> 00:41:35.049
Berserker?

00:41:36.117 --> 00:41:37.652
Please, no.

00:41:37.652 --> 00:41:39.086
Don't come inside.

00:41:39.086 --> 00:41:41.055
[gasping]

00:41:46.594 --> 00:41:47.962
[metal clanks]

00:41:49.130 --> 00:41:51.232
- Sakura is calling.

00:41:51.232 --> 00:41:54.035
Lucky for you, I have to go.

00:41:58.072 --> 00:42:01.209
No. It's not luck.

00:42:01.209 --> 00:42:03.878
You earned this for yourself...

00:42:03.878 --> 00:42:04.979
for now.

00:42:13.721 --> 00:42:14.989
- [sighs]

00:42:14.989 --> 00:42:16.524
- Shirou!

00:42:17.625 --> 00:42:19.694
[gasps] Shirou.

00:42:22.096 --> 00:42:23.631
- It's all right.

00:42:25.800 --> 00:42:27.935
It's all right now.

00:42:27.935 --> 00:42:28.936
Let's go home.

00:42:32.673 --> 00:42:33.808
[blade slices]

00:42:33.808 --> 00:42:36.277
[gags]

00:42:38.913 --> 00:42:40.681
[groans]

00:42:41.749 --> 00:42:44.552
[groans]

00:42:49.056 --> 00:42:50.958
[gags]

00:42:50.958 --> 00:42:52.927
[groaning]

00:43:12.880 --> 00:43:13.981
[sighs]

00:43:13.981 --> 00:43:15.316
[chain rattles]

00:43:15.316 --> 00:43:17.285
[groaning]

00:43:19.287 --> 00:43:21.255
[panting]

00:43:30.831 --> 00:43:32.867
That's what happens
when I use it.

00:43:33.968 --> 00:43:35.236
[groans]

00:43:35.236 --> 00:43:37.972
- [door slides open]
- [gasps]

00:43:42.143 --> 00:43:44.812
- Oh, you're finally awake.
How nice.

00:43:44.812 --> 00:43:46.113
- Tohsaka!

00:43:46.113 --> 00:43:48.015
You're all right.

00:43:49.050 --> 00:43:50.251
- Of course I am.

00:43:50.251 --> 00:43:53.287
Especially compared
to, say, you?

00:43:53.287 --> 00:43:54.755
- Uh...

00:43:54.755 --> 00:43:56.257
[nervous chuckle]

00:43:56.257 --> 00:43:59.160
- Well, at least
you're still alive.

00:43:59.160 --> 00:44:00.328
[gasps]

00:44:00.328 --> 00:44:01.596
Wait. What is that?

00:44:01.596 --> 00:44:02.964
- Huh?

00:44:02.964 --> 00:44:05.666
Oh, it's--it's, um...

00:44:06.801 --> 00:44:08.836
It's something special.

00:44:10.738 --> 00:44:13.674
I need to keep it
until the end.

00:44:15.042 --> 00:44:17.011
What the...

00:44:17.011 --> 00:44:18.646
That was weird.

00:44:18.646 --> 00:44:20.114
What did I say?

00:44:20.114 --> 00:44:22.049
- Hold on to it.

00:44:22.049 --> 00:44:24.719
Looks like there's
a little magical energy left.

00:44:24.719 --> 00:44:26.354
Could be useful.

00:44:26.354 --> 00:44:28.923
Sounds like that
was your plan anyway.

00:44:29.957 --> 00:44:32.927
Um, yeah.

00:44:32.927 --> 00:44:35.296
- [sighs]

00:44:35.296 --> 00:44:37.798
Now hurry up,
and get ready, okay?

00:44:37.798 --> 00:44:39.834
We're heading out now.

00:44:39.834 --> 00:44:42.703
[footsteps shuffling]

00:44:47.041 --> 00:44:48.009
- Huh?

00:44:49.076 --> 00:44:51.145
- You are
the last two masters left

00:44:51.145 --> 00:44:53.080
in this Holy Grail War,

00:44:53.080 --> 00:44:55.049
so I'm going
to tell you the truth.

00:44:56.317 --> 00:44:58.285
I'll cut to the heart
of the matter.

00:44:58.285 --> 00:45:00.821
It should explain some things.

00:45:00.821 --> 00:45:02.957
However, the first part

00:45:02.957 --> 00:45:05.026
is nothing that concerns
either of you.

00:45:05.026 --> 00:45:06.260
- [gasps]

00:45:07.294 --> 00:45:09.363
- You know the rules of the War.

00:45:09.363 --> 00:45:12.767
Using seven Heroic Spirits,
participants kill each other

00:45:12.767 --> 00:45:14.702
to determine
the rights to the Grail.

00:45:15.836 --> 00:45:20.775
But the truth is
those rules are only a ploy.

00:45:20.775 --> 00:45:24.345
In fact, Masters are
merely the catalysts

00:45:24.345 --> 00:45:27.948
to summon the Servants
to this world.

00:45:27.948 --> 00:45:30.251
Only the Heroic Spirits
are required

00:45:30.251 --> 00:45:32.119
to complete the Holy Grail.

00:45:33.154 --> 00:45:35.022
Their souls are harvested

00:45:35.022 --> 00:45:39.126
and placed into the Lesser Grail
created by the Einzberns.

00:45:39.126 --> 00:45:43.097
The Greater Grail requires them
in order to be activated.

00:45:43.097 --> 00:45:45.866
- Uh, the Greater Grail?

00:45:45.866 --> 00:45:49.970
- It's a magic circle
on the Tohsaka family land,

00:45:49.970 --> 00:45:53.040
the overseer
of the Holy Grail War system.

00:45:54.475 --> 00:45:57.912
It all started 300 years ago.

00:45:57.912 --> 00:46:02.083
The three founding families,
Einzbern, Makiri, and Tohsaka,

00:46:02.083 --> 00:46:06.454
wanted to use the Holy Grail
to reach outside of the world.

00:46:06.454 --> 00:46:09.290
That's the true objective,

00:46:09.290 --> 00:46:12.493
the ritual once thought lost
to the Einzberns,

00:46:12.493 --> 00:46:16.897
great magic that could make
true immortality possible.

00:46:16.897 --> 00:46:19.033
The Grail of Heaven,

00:46:19.033 --> 00:46:21.202
Heaven's Feel.

00:46:21.202 --> 00:46:23.838
The secret
to materializing the soul.

00:46:23.838 --> 00:46:25.306
- [gasps]

00:46:28.042 --> 00:46:29.744
- Now then...

00:46:29.744 --> 00:46:32.413
the rest of the story
does concern you two.

00:46:32.413 --> 00:46:33.948
[both gasp]

00:46:33.948 --> 00:46:37.218
- You mean Sakura, right?
Please, Illya.

00:46:37.218 --> 00:46:39.887
I need to know what the hell's
happening to her.

00:46:39.887 --> 00:46:42.890
- Zouken has changed her,

00:46:42.890 --> 00:46:46.093
because he is trying
to get control of something,

00:46:46.093 --> 00:46:48.529
something called Avenger.

00:46:49.964 --> 00:46:53.300
It's the eighth class
within the Holy Grail War.

00:46:53.300 --> 00:46:55.136
It fused with Sakura

00:46:55.136 --> 00:46:58.773
and used her
to project those black shadows,

00:46:58.773 --> 00:47:00.341
Angra Mainyu.

00:47:01.509 --> 00:47:04.178
It's a story
from an ancient village

00:47:04.178 --> 00:47:07.248
that practiced Zoroastrianism.

00:47:07.248 --> 00:47:08.983
The people wished to find a way

00:47:08.983 --> 00:47:11.786
for humans to live
a pure and just life

00:47:11.786 --> 00:47:13.420
and believed that, to do this,

00:47:13.420 --> 00:47:16.423
they must first be freed
of all their evils.

00:47:16.423 --> 00:47:20.561
So they randomly selected
one unlucky young man

00:47:20.561 --> 00:47:22.129
and singled him out.

00:47:22.129 --> 00:47:26.500
They placed all the sins
of the world on his shoulders,

00:47:26.500 --> 00:47:28.269
using his "wickedness"

00:47:28.269 --> 00:47:31.939
to prove the "goodness"
of all humans except him.

00:47:33.007 --> 00:47:34.809
They tortured him,

00:47:34.809 --> 00:47:38.412
and thus a hero was born.

00:47:38.412 --> 00:47:40.848
He was resented by the people,

00:47:40.848 --> 00:47:44.118
yet worshipped as a god
at the same time,

00:47:44.118 --> 00:47:46.987
someone who was no one,

00:47:46.987 --> 00:47:50.558
the anti-hero, Angra Mainyu.

00:47:52.459 --> 00:47:55.563
During the Third War,
the Einzbern family

00:47:55.563 --> 00:47:58.999
summoned Angra Mainyu
to act as their Servant.

00:48:00.301 --> 00:48:04.238
However, he was very weak.

00:48:04.238 --> 00:48:08.375
He was quickly defeated and
absorbed into the Greater Grail.

00:48:10.477 --> 00:48:13.380
And then, as a result,

00:48:13.380 --> 00:48:16.450
the Holy Grail
accepted a certain wish.

00:48:18.552 --> 00:48:22.623
It is an existence made by those
who willed its evil into being.

00:48:24.091 --> 00:48:26.060
And now because of the Grail,

00:48:26.060 --> 00:48:28.229
it has become a reality.

00:48:29.463 --> 00:48:32.299
It is the embodiment
of all the world's evil.

00:48:32.299 --> 00:48:34.501
Given the chance,
it will curse the lives

00:48:34.501 --> 00:48:36.537
of every human on the planet.

00:48:37.605 --> 00:48:41.308
That is the true identity
of the shadow.

00:48:44.979 --> 00:48:47.014
At the end of the last War,

00:48:47.014 --> 00:48:49.950
Kiritsugu destroyed the Grail.

00:48:51.118 --> 00:48:55.022
there was no way
for Angra Mainyu to be born.

00:48:55.022 --> 00:48:59.026
It was left
inside the Greater Grail.

00:48:59.026 --> 00:49:03.097
Part of it attached itself
to Kirei Kotomine,

00:49:03.097 --> 00:49:07.234
and Zouken turned Sakura
into an artificial Grail.

00:49:07.234 --> 00:49:11.572
He took a shard of what remained
and planted it inside her.

00:49:12.907 --> 00:49:14.909
But Avenger's still a Servant,

00:49:14.909 --> 00:49:18.145
and a Servant
must obey its Master.

00:49:18.145 --> 00:49:20.915
And since Zouken
controls Sakura,

00:49:20.915 --> 00:49:22.449
he made her a Master,

00:49:22.449 --> 00:49:24.652
giving him control of Avenger.

00:49:24.652 --> 00:49:26.287
- [gasps]

00:49:26.287 --> 00:49:28.555
Master...

00:49:28.555 --> 00:49:30.491
and Servant.

00:49:30.491 --> 00:49:34.662
ILLYA: Optimistically,
she has half a day left.

00:49:34.662 --> 00:49:39.366
If that thing is fully born,
she will transform completely.

00:49:39.366 --> 00:49:41.502
No one will be able to save her.

00:49:41.502 --> 00:49:44.071
No one will be saved at all.

00:49:48.309 --> 00:49:51.412
RIN: Okay, Shirou,
I want you to do something

00:49:51.412 --> 00:49:54.248
before we go running
into enemy territory.

00:49:55.950 --> 00:49:59.486
To be honest, you may have saved
us all by bringing Illya back.

00:50:00.721 --> 00:50:03.490
The two of you are going
to need to work together.

00:50:03.490 --> 00:50:05.426
Take the memories
of the Einzberns

00:50:05.426 --> 00:50:08.362
and the memories of the land
where the Leyline flows.

00:50:08.362 --> 00:50:11.532
Use them to project
a special weapon,

00:50:11.532 --> 00:50:13.000
the Jeweled Sword.

00:50:14.101 --> 00:50:16.670
- [breeze blows]
- SHIROU: Why? What is it?

00:50:16.670 --> 00:50:18.105
RIN: The Tohsakas have held

00:50:18.105 --> 00:50:20.607
that treasure's secret
for generations,

00:50:20.607 --> 00:50:23.310
and now...

00:50:23.310 --> 00:50:25.980
we're going to use it
to fight Sakura.

00:50:27.014 --> 00:50:28.115
- [sighs]

00:50:29.183 --> 00:50:31.051
All right.

00:50:31.051 --> 00:50:33.620
[footsteps echoing]

00:50:33.620 --> 00:50:34.989
- [sighs]

00:50:37.091 --> 00:50:39.626
The Azoth Blade
closely resembles it.

00:50:39.626 --> 00:50:42.997
I've infused it
with ten years of my mana.

00:50:42.997 --> 00:50:45.366
Use it
to support your projection.

00:50:45.366 --> 00:50:47.601
[water flowing]

00:50:50.637 --> 00:50:52.573
ILLYA: Shirou...

00:50:52.573 --> 00:50:54.074
tell me the truth.

00:50:54.074 --> 00:50:56.010
How long do you think
you can last?

00:50:59.046 --> 00:51:01.281
- [sighs]

00:51:01.281 --> 00:51:03.083
I honestly don't know.

00:51:04.485 --> 00:51:08.022
But hey, I'll keep going
as long as I'm alive.

00:51:08.022 --> 00:51:09.256
- [gasps]

00:51:09.256 --> 00:51:10.424
[shudders]

00:51:10.424 --> 00:51:11.458
- [whimpers]
- Ohh.

00:51:14.261 --> 00:51:15.462
[chuckles]

00:51:15.462 --> 00:51:17.064
I'm gonna be okay.

00:51:22.236 --> 00:51:24.204
- [sighing]

00:51:26.640 --> 00:51:28.509
Focus on the sword.

00:51:28.509 --> 00:51:30.511
Only look at what you need to.

00:51:32.112 --> 00:51:34.748
- Uh, okay.
- [shuddering]

00:51:40.721 --> 00:51:42.689
[seabirds calling]

00:51:44.324 --> 00:51:45.459
- The ocean?

00:51:46.493 --> 00:51:48.829
- [grunts] Shirou.

00:51:48.829 --> 00:51:49.797
- [sighs]

00:51:52.566 --> 00:51:54.535
[soft music playing]

00:52:03.143 --> 00:52:04.445
Shinji?

00:52:05.512 --> 00:52:07.114
No.

00:52:07.114 --> 00:52:09.316
- It's not here.

00:52:09.316 --> 00:52:11.285
Let's jump further ahead.

00:52:11.285 --> 00:52:12.252
- Huh.

00:52:14.455 --> 00:52:15.722
[gasps]

00:52:22.496 --> 00:52:24.465
[birds chirping]

00:52:27.501 --> 00:52:29.403
- [gasps]

00:52:29.403 --> 00:52:32.439
- Little bit further. Let's go.

00:52:32.439 --> 00:52:33.440
- Uh, what--

00:52:38.745 --> 00:52:40.647
ZELRETCH: ...all forms
of evil eradicated.

00:52:40.647 --> 00:52:44.585
- This is the right place.
- you sought out a miracle.

00:52:44.585 --> 00:52:47.654
- Shirou, don't take
your eyes off of him.

00:52:47.654 --> 00:52:48.722
- [gasps]

00:52:48.722 --> 00:52:52.426
- This objective
has my full support.

00:52:52.426 --> 00:52:54.695
Because they wish
to reach the Root,

00:52:54.695 --> 00:52:59.166
the three members,
Einzbern, Tohsaka, and Makiri,

00:52:59.166 --> 00:53:02.569
will cooperate with each other
to open the path.

00:53:02.569 --> 00:53:05.839
Declare your contributions
to this cause.

00:53:05.839 --> 00:53:09.143
- So declared,
the Tohsakas offer

00:53:09.143 --> 00:53:11.912
the spiritual grounds
to build the Holy Grail.

00:53:11.912 --> 00:53:15.883
- So declared, The Makiris
offer the Command Spell

00:53:15.883 --> 00:53:18.785
for the Servants
so they may be sacrificed.

00:53:18.785 --> 00:53:22.289
- It is so declared,
the Einzberns offer

00:53:22.289 --> 00:53:25.492
the magic circle
to reach the Third Magic.

00:53:25.492 --> 00:53:29.796
- Good.
I, Kischur Zelretch Schweinorg,

00:53:29.796 --> 00:53:32.900
will be acting as the witness
for this ritual.

00:53:32.900 --> 00:53:35.302
You may now begin.

00:53:46.680 --> 00:53:48.649
[rumbling]

00:53:51.185 --> 00:53:52.252
- [sighs]

00:53:56.957 --> 00:53:58.492
[Makiri grunts]

00:54:02.262 --> 00:54:04.231
[rumbling]

00:54:08.335 --> 00:54:10.470
O gate connecting
to the Root...

00:54:12.472 --> 00:54:13.941
be released.

00:54:17.544 --> 00:54:19.680
[rumbling fades]

00:54:20.948 --> 00:54:23.483
- [shudders]

00:54:23.483 --> 00:54:24.718
- [gasps]

00:54:25.886 --> 00:54:27.354
Be released.

00:54:28.388 --> 00:54:29.890
- [stammers]

00:54:29.890 --> 00:54:31.225
[sighs]

00:54:31.225 --> 00:54:33.493
Be released.

00:54:39.633 --> 00:54:41.602
[ominous music playing]

00:54:49.243 --> 00:54:50.544
- Shirou!

00:54:50.544 --> 00:54:52.312
- [gasps]

00:54:53.814 --> 00:54:54.815
[blade scrapes]

00:54:54.815 --> 00:54:56.383
[chime rings]

00:55:00.387 --> 00:55:01.488
[gasps]

00:55:08.362 --> 00:55:10.330
[Shirou panting]

00:55:15.936 --> 00:55:17.371
[whoosh]

00:55:19.406 --> 00:55:20.741
[groans]

00:55:22.643 --> 00:55:24.745
[sighing]

00:55:24.745 --> 00:55:26.780
- You look terrible,

00:55:26.780 --> 00:55:29.416
like death itself.

00:55:29.416 --> 00:55:32.819
- Uh, R-Rider?

00:55:32.819 --> 00:55:36.757
- I've been watching you
from a distance.

00:55:36.757 --> 00:55:38.825
- [gasps]

00:55:38.825 --> 00:55:42.929
- My sworn duty is
to protect you, Shirou Emiya,

00:55:42.929 --> 00:55:46.600
but you've created a weapon
to use against Sakura.

00:55:46.600 --> 00:55:48.702
- [gasps]

00:55:48.702 --> 00:55:52.339
- As long as you plan
on bringing harm to her,

00:55:52.339 --> 00:55:54.441
I cannot protect you.

00:55:55.909 --> 00:55:57.411
[chain rattles]

00:55:57.411 --> 00:55:59.379
- [gasps]

00:55:59.379 --> 00:56:02.516
So, what, you here to kill me?

00:56:03.650 --> 00:56:06.920
- Shirou, you should know

00:56:06.920 --> 00:56:10.624
Sakura summoned me
without the use of a catalyst.

00:56:10.624 --> 00:56:11.892
- Huh?

00:56:11.892 --> 00:56:15.495
- When that happens,
the Servant that is chosen

00:56:15.495 --> 00:56:18.699
is very close
to the Master's state.

00:56:19.800 --> 00:56:21.635
Honestly...

00:56:21.635 --> 00:56:24.438
I didn't want
to turn her into a monster.

00:56:26.640 --> 00:56:29.609
But now...

00:56:29.609 --> 00:56:31.411
[gasps]

00:56:31.411 --> 00:56:35.682
Shirou, I cannot let you
make Sakura suffer.

00:56:35.682 --> 00:56:38.485
- I'm not gonna kill her.

00:56:38.485 --> 00:56:40.654
I'm going to save her.

00:56:41.688 --> 00:56:44.925
I promise.
I'm on Sakura's side.

00:56:44.925 --> 00:56:46.360
- [gasps]

00:56:47.928 --> 00:56:51.698
- No matter what comes to pass,
I'll choose her.

00:56:51.698 --> 00:56:54.768
- On her side?

00:56:54.768 --> 00:56:57.871
Is this your answer
to my question?

00:56:57.871 --> 00:56:59.973
But can I trust you?

00:56:59.973 --> 00:57:04.678
- For this to work, there's
someone I still have to beat,

00:57:04.678 --> 00:57:06.880
and I could really use
your help now.

00:57:09.049 --> 00:57:10.150
- [sighs]

00:57:12.452 --> 00:57:14.755
Do we have
a fair chance of winning?

00:57:14.755 --> 00:57:15.856
- Yes.

00:57:18.525 --> 00:57:19.693
Then I'm with you.

00:57:26.133 --> 00:57:27.934
Your Servant, Rider.

00:57:28.969 --> 00:57:30.404
It's only temporary,

00:57:30.404 --> 00:57:33.006
but I shall become your wings.

00:57:33.006 --> 00:57:35.942
We'll go as far as we can
for Sakura.

00:57:39.446 --> 00:57:41.481
[ominous music playing]

00:57:44.751 --> 00:57:47.053
- [gasping]

00:57:51.992 --> 00:57:53.827
Hmph.

00:57:53.827 --> 00:57:56.696
For a second there, I thought
you were actually coming back.

00:57:56.696 --> 00:57:57.731
[whoosh]

00:57:57.731 --> 00:58:00.734
But you only flew out
your shadow.

00:58:00.734 --> 00:58:04.805
Flexing our muscles, are we?
How cute.

00:58:04.805 --> 00:58:06.139
SAKURBig Sister...

00:58:06.139 --> 00:58:09.543
please take Shirou,
and run away.

00:58:09.543 --> 00:58:11.745
If you do that for me,

00:58:11.745 --> 00:58:15.882
I promise
I'll give my life to kill it.

00:58:15.882 --> 00:58:17.684
[heart beats]

00:58:17.684 --> 00:58:21.855
- I gotta ask,
even though I know the answer,

00:58:21.855 --> 00:58:25.525
do you want to cut ties
with Angra Mainyu?

00:58:25.525 --> 00:58:27.561
[shadow crackles]

00:58:29.529 --> 00:58:31.231
- No, I don't.

00:58:31.231 --> 00:58:34.568
For the first time in my life,
I have power.

00:58:34.568 --> 00:58:38.104
Even if I did want
to let go of it, I couldn't.

00:58:39.239 --> 00:58:41.942
- So you're saying
if I take Shirou away,

00:58:41.942 --> 00:58:44.077
you'll stop this
by killing yourself

00:58:44.077 --> 00:58:46.980
and taking
Angra Mainyu with you?

00:58:48.548 --> 00:58:51.151
- Yes, that's right. Please.

00:58:51.151 --> 00:58:52.953
[crackling]

00:58:52.953 --> 00:58:54.754
- That's a lie.

00:58:54.754 --> 00:58:56.890
The truth is
you don't know how much longer

00:58:56.890 --> 00:58:58.925
you can keep
holding yourself back.

00:58:58.925 --> 00:58:59.960
- [gasps]

00:58:59.960 --> 00:59:02.596
- Didn't you notice?

00:59:02.596 --> 00:59:06.099
Oh, come on. You can't even
keep your story straight.

00:59:06.099 --> 00:59:09.736
First you said you'd
give your life to kill it.

00:59:09.736 --> 00:59:12.172
Then you said
you could never give it up.

00:59:12.172 --> 00:59:13.507
- [gasps]

00:59:13.507 --> 00:59:15.742
[flowing]

00:59:17.277 --> 00:59:19.045
- Just be patient,

00:59:19.045 --> 00:59:21.014
because I'm coming for you.

00:59:22.182 --> 00:59:26.286
And then I'll be sure
to kill you myself.

00:59:28.054 --> 00:59:29.623
- Yes.

00:59:29.623 --> 00:59:33.026
I'll be waiting for you,
Big Sister.

00:59:35.962 --> 00:59:37.998
[gasps]

00:59:37.998 --> 00:59:39.866
Big Sister.

00:59:39.866 --> 00:59:41.635
[shuddering]

00:59:45.205 --> 00:59:47.007
[rubble clatters]

00:59:47.007 --> 00:59:48.975
[water dripping]

00:59:50.777 --> 00:59:54.247
ZOUKEN: Good to see you
make it back here, Assassin.

00:59:54.247 --> 00:59:57.183
- Lord Magus, you're alive?

00:59:57.183 --> 01:00:00.220
- I am.
But in my current state,

01:00:00.220 --> 01:00:04.558
I cannot supply you
with magical energy.

01:00:04.558 --> 01:00:07.961
Sakura, this will
put a burden on you,

01:00:07.961 --> 01:00:10.664
but you must forge a pact
with Assassin.

01:00:13.166 --> 01:00:14.301
Sakura.

01:00:18.238 --> 01:00:21.775
- My Lord, I think the girl...

01:00:21.775 --> 01:00:23.043
is gone.

01:00:24.844 --> 01:00:26.613
- Oh.

01:00:26.613 --> 01:00:29.082
What a disappointing
conclusion.

01:00:30.250 --> 01:00:33.853
- What will you do,
proceed with the plan?

01:00:33.853 --> 01:00:36.022
- You can hardly call it that,

01:00:36.022 --> 01:00:38.258
but there's no choice.

01:00:38.258 --> 01:00:39.593
[skittering]

01:00:39.593 --> 01:00:42.195
Farewell, Sakura.

01:00:42.195 --> 01:00:44.864
You've endured
more than I ever expected

01:00:44.864 --> 01:00:46.967
from a mere guinea pig.

01:00:46.967 --> 01:00:48.768
Delightful.

01:00:48.768 --> 01:00:50.870
- There's no need for that,
Grandfather.

01:00:50.870 --> 01:00:51.871
[ominous music playing]

01:00:51.871 --> 01:00:53.206
ZOUKEOh?

01:00:55.342 --> 01:00:56.643
- [grunts]

01:00:56.643 --> 01:00:58.712
- [chittering]

01:01:02.115 --> 01:01:04.050
[screams]

01:01:09.923 --> 01:01:11.891
[gagging]

01:01:15.328 --> 01:01:16.830
SAKURA: Oh, that's why.

01:01:16.830 --> 01:01:18.798
You were hiding the fact

01:01:18.798 --> 01:01:20.667
that you
don't even have a face.

01:01:20.667 --> 01:01:22.268
- [gags]

01:01:22.268 --> 01:01:24.070
Damn you.

01:01:24.070 --> 01:01:27.974
- You're a nobody
belonging nowhere.

01:01:27.974 --> 01:01:31.244
You're never going to become
the one-and-only anything.

01:01:31.244 --> 01:01:33.146
- [gags]

01:01:33.146 --> 01:01:37.117
I just want to know my--

01:01:37.117 --> 01:01:38.852
[gags]

01:01:41.087 --> 01:01:45.025
- Wh-What do you
think you're doing, Sakura?

01:01:45.025 --> 01:01:46.726
- [chuckles]

01:01:46.726 --> 01:01:48.728
That's obvious.

01:01:48.728 --> 01:01:51.431
You no longer needed
to be protected by him,

01:01:51.431 --> 01:01:52.932
did you, Grandfather?

01:01:56.369 --> 01:01:58.171
[Zouken moans]

01:01:58.171 --> 01:02:00.240
- I spent so much time

01:02:00.240 --> 01:02:04.177
wondering how, wherever I went,
you were always with me

01:02:04.177 --> 01:02:06.880
and why I let you do
whatever you wanted.

01:02:09.249 --> 01:02:12.185
It's exactly what I expected.

01:02:12.185 --> 01:02:14.387
- [squeals]

01:02:16.256 --> 01:02:20.260
- The real you has been
hiding inside my body all along.

01:02:20.260 --> 01:02:23.196
[giggles]

01:02:23.196 --> 01:02:25.065
Honestly, Grandfather,

01:02:25.065 --> 01:02:28.334
I thought for sure you were
going to be bigger than that.

01:02:29.936 --> 01:02:31.404
- [crunching]
- No!

01:02:31.404 --> 01:02:33.239
Sakura, please, wait!

01:02:34.407 --> 01:02:37.410
- This is goodbye, Grandfather.

01:02:45.218 --> 01:02:47.821
[giggles]

01:02:47.821 --> 01:02:49.355
First my brother,

01:02:49.355 --> 01:02:51.858
and now
Grandfather's gone, too.

01:02:51.858 --> 01:02:53.059
Next, I...

01:02:54.260 --> 01:02:56.129
Next, I can...

01:02:57.864 --> 01:02:58.865
What?

01:03:02.001 --> 01:03:04.037
What am I going to do now?

01:03:06.406 --> 01:03:08.374
[pained gasping]

01:03:12.746 --> 01:03:14.748
SABER: We're not finished.

01:03:14.748 --> 01:03:16.516
Not yet.

01:03:16.516 --> 01:03:18.151
There are more.

01:03:18.151 --> 01:03:19.319
[armor clinks]

01:03:19.319 --> 01:03:20.954
They'll be here soon.

01:03:25.458 --> 01:03:26.893
- Go, please.

01:03:26.893 --> 01:03:30.063
Only let Big Sister
pass through.

01:03:30.063 --> 01:03:31.831
- And Shirou Emiya?

01:03:31.831 --> 01:03:33.199
- [swallows]

01:03:33.199 --> 01:03:34.467
[stammers]

01:03:40.406 --> 01:03:42.375
[sentimental music playing]

01:04:27.587 --> 01:04:28.588
- [sighs]

01:04:32.258 --> 01:04:36.329
[thinkinI'm amazed,
but it's more than I realized.

01:04:39.399 --> 01:04:43.102
I care about Sakura.
She means everything to me.

01:04:48.308 --> 01:04:49.609
- This is it.

01:04:49.609 --> 01:04:51.377
Good luck.

01:04:51.377 --> 01:04:53.179
Rin...

01:04:53.179 --> 01:04:54.948
Rider...

01:04:54.948 --> 01:04:56.482
Shirou.

01:05:01.254 --> 01:05:02.889
- Illya...

01:05:02.889 --> 01:05:05.391
after this battle's over,

01:05:05.391 --> 01:05:08.528
you may not have
a place to go back to,

01:05:08.528 --> 01:05:11.364
but you could
keep living at my house.

01:05:11.364 --> 01:05:15.168
- Are you going
to replace Kiritsugu?

01:05:15.168 --> 01:05:19.305
- Uh, no. Kiritsugu and I
are different people.

01:05:21.107 --> 01:05:22.308
But I will--

01:05:25.345 --> 01:05:27.580
- [sighs]

01:05:30.350 --> 01:05:31.451
- Um...

01:05:31.451 --> 01:05:33.553
- Shirou, crouch down, please.

01:05:33.553 --> 01:05:36.256
- Uh, o-okay.

01:05:42.595 --> 01:05:44.564
[sighs]

01:05:44.564 --> 01:05:46.266
- [giggles]

01:05:46.266 --> 01:05:48.601
Be careful, Shirou.
You got that?

01:05:48.601 --> 01:05:50.270
Be home by morning,

01:05:50.270 --> 01:05:53.106
and make sure
you bring Sakura back with you.

01:05:55.041 --> 01:05:57.176
- [grunts]

01:05:57.176 --> 01:05:59.145
[distant humming]

01:06:00.914 --> 01:06:03.316
[energy hums]

01:06:03.316 --> 01:06:05.285
[birds squawking]

01:06:10.189 --> 01:06:11.591
RIDER: I sense something,

01:06:11.591 --> 01:06:14.661
a field of power
being generated up at the lake.

01:06:16.229 --> 01:06:19.465
RIN: The field up there
is the dummy gate.

01:06:19.465 --> 01:06:22.068
But we're here to find
the Greater Grail,

01:06:22.068 --> 01:06:23.336
so...

01:06:23.336 --> 01:06:24.570
- [whoosh]
- [yelps]

01:06:24.570 --> 01:06:27.006
[gasps]

01:06:27.006 --> 01:06:30.510
- We're gonna have to go down
and not up.

01:06:30.510 --> 01:06:31.477
[whoosh]

01:06:34.380 --> 01:06:35.715
- Going down.

01:06:35.715 --> 01:06:37.684
[soft music playing]

01:06:58.304 --> 01:06:59.439
[gasps]

01:07:06.379 --> 01:07:08.314
[gasps]

01:07:08.314 --> 01:07:09.716
- [panting] What's the matter?

01:07:10.750 --> 01:07:12.652
- Uh, nothing.

01:07:12.652 --> 01:07:14.387
- Don't lose focus.

01:07:14.387 --> 01:07:18.057
From this point forward,
just worry about your own life.

01:07:36.709 --> 01:07:38.678
- Saber.

01:07:41.381 --> 01:07:42.582
- Rin.

01:07:44.717 --> 01:07:46.452
- [gasps]

01:07:46.452 --> 01:07:48.154
Oh, I get it.

01:07:51.290 --> 01:07:53.659
Sakura's taking this seriously.

01:07:53.659 --> 01:07:56.262
[dramatic music playing]

01:07:56.262 --> 01:07:58.031
[inhales]

01:07:58.031 --> 01:08:00.233
[exhales]

01:08:00.233 --> 01:08:03.136
Sorry, guys.
I'm gonna go ahead without you.

01:08:07.106 --> 01:08:09.242
If you're planning
on saving Sakura, Shirou,

01:08:09.242 --> 01:08:11.110
you'd better catch up quick.

01:08:30.530 --> 01:08:34.200
SHIROU: Saber, I'm sorry,
but we're coming through.

01:08:34.200 --> 01:08:35.668
- You won't.

01:08:35.668 --> 01:08:38.237
This is the role I was given.

01:08:40.206 --> 01:08:44.310
- Using all my powers, I can
hold her off for two minutes.

01:08:44.310 --> 01:08:46.579
I'll find
an opportunity for you.

01:08:47.613 --> 01:08:48.848
[clasp clicks]

01:08:48.848 --> 01:08:50.750
Wait here, and watch,

01:08:50.750 --> 01:08:53.519
but don't miss your chance.

01:08:53.519 --> 01:08:54.487
- [grunts]

01:08:57.623 --> 01:09:01.294
Saber, we will eliminate you
right here.

01:09:01.294 --> 01:09:02.395
[chorus vocalizing]

01:09:02.395 --> 01:09:04.697
I'm going to save Sakura.

01:09:05.865 --> 01:09:07.733
[growls]

01:09:07.733 --> 01:09:10.703
Which means I'll kill you.

01:09:10.703 --> 01:09:12.271
- [scoffs]

01:09:13.372 --> 01:09:14.674
[chorus continues]

01:09:31.657 --> 01:09:32.658
[chorus ends]

01:09:35.228 --> 01:09:37.730
[footsteps echoing]

01:09:37.730 --> 01:09:39.665
- [gasps]

01:09:42.702 --> 01:09:44.537
- [chitters]

01:09:44.537 --> 01:09:45.805
- [sighs]

01:09:47.340 --> 01:09:49.308
- [chittering]

01:10:11.931 --> 01:10:12.899
- [grunts]

01:10:29.248 --> 01:10:31.951
This is it, the Greater Grail.

01:10:39.692 --> 01:10:43.429
SAKURA: You came all the way
here instead of running.

01:10:49.268 --> 01:10:50.736
I've been thinking.

01:10:53.206 --> 01:10:54.874
And I've realized...

01:10:54.874 --> 01:10:56.609
I hate this world.

01:10:57.643 --> 01:11:01.681
The house, you, Grandfather,

01:11:01.681 --> 01:11:03.683
my pathetic Big Brother,

01:11:03.683 --> 01:11:05.851
the whole "peaceful" city.

01:11:05.851 --> 01:11:08.721
Everyone who never made
an effort to save me

01:11:08.721 --> 01:11:10.389
is unforgiveable.

01:11:11.490 --> 01:11:13.693
I'm taking my anger out on them,

01:11:13.693 --> 01:11:16.429
and I realize
that it's not healthy.

01:11:16.429 --> 01:11:19.565
But I've become
so much stronger.

01:11:20.933 --> 01:11:24.337
I can do
anything I want to now.

01:11:24.337 --> 01:11:25.638
- Really?

01:11:25.638 --> 01:11:27.907
You've gotten used
to murder, have you?

01:11:27.907 --> 01:11:29.875
- Yes.

01:11:29.875 --> 01:11:33.379
Grandfather and Assassin
can't bother me now.

01:11:33.379 --> 01:11:35.615
- And all that's left--
- And what about Shirou?

01:11:35.615 --> 01:11:37.283
- [gasps]

01:11:37.283 --> 01:11:39.418
- That fool.

01:11:39.418 --> 01:11:43.289
He still has it in his head
that he can save you.

01:11:43.289 --> 01:11:45.958
- Shirou is the only person
in the whole world

01:11:45.958 --> 01:11:47.793
I want to kill.

01:11:47.793 --> 01:11:49.962
- How sad.

01:11:49.962 --> 01:11:52.598
You've already given up
on your humanity.

01:11:52.598 --> 01:11:55.635
- You act so tough.

01:11:55.635 --> 01:11:58.638
You're jealous of this power,
aren't you?

01:11:58.638 --> 01:12:00.406
You want to take it from me

01:12:00.406 --> 01:12:03.309
so that you
and you alone can be happy.

01:12:05.578 --> 01:12:07.780
- [chittering]

01:12:10.616 --> 01:12:13.419
[childlike music playing]

01:12:13.419 --> 01:12:14.987
SAKURA: You can't have it.

01:12:14.987 --> 01:12:17.857
But there are two things
I will give you,

01:12:17.857 --> 01:12:19.792
regret and despair.

01:12:22.862 --> 01:12:24.030
[heavy thud]

01:12:25.798 --> 01:12:27.767
- [soft growling]

01:12:30.469 --> 01:12:33.472
- You shall drown
inside the Grail of Heaven,

01:12:33.472 --> 01:12:35.908
like a bug dropped into a lake.

01:12:39.445 --> 01:12:41.580
[energetic music playing]

01:12:48.988 --> 01:12:49.955
[chains rattle]

01:12:51.023 --> 01:12:52.725
- [grunts]

01:12:52.725 --> 01:12:54.927
[woman vocalizing]

01:13:15.781 --> 01:13:16.982
[grunts]

01:13:21.354 --> 01:13:22.688
[gasps]

01:13:25.358 --> 01:13:26.759
[gasps]

01:13:28.094 --> 01:13:29.362
- [growls]

01:13:30.830 --> 01:13:32.465
[vocalizing continues]

01:13:35.034 --> 01:13:36.402
- Damn it.

01:13:36.402 --> 01:13:37.570
[sword clangs]

01:13:47.880 --> 01:13:50.449
- The curse of Mystic Eyes.
- [flesh crackling]

01:13:53.886 --> 01:13:54.887
[vocalizing ends]

01:13:54.887 --> 01:13:56.789
- [grunts]

01:13:59.992 --> 01:14:01.127
[shudders]

01:14:02.161 --> 01:14:05.498
Rider, I wanted to ask,

01:14:05.498 --> 01:14:09.034
about Saber, is it possible
for someone to damage her

01:14:09.034 --> 01:14:10.803
if they're not a Servant?

01:14:10.803 --> 01:14:15.574
- Yes. Sakura's captive Servants
are all incarnations.

01:14:16.642 --> 01:14:19.578
A powerful Mystic Code
should be enough.

01:14:21.013 --> 01:14:22.982
- That's good news.

01:14:22.982 --> 01:14:25.651
Then I know what we
need to do to beat her.

01:14:33.125 --> 01:14:36.529
- Yes, that strategy
could very well do the trick.

01:14:36.529 --> 01:14:37.830
- Uh-huh.

01:14:37.830 --> 01:14:38.831
Except...

01:14:38.831 --> 01:14:41.801
- We'll have to trust
each other.

01:14:41.801 --> 01:14:43.068
Do we?

01:14:44.770 --> 01:14:49.675
Shirou, Are you able to stand by
when an ally's in danger?

01:14:51.644 --> 01:14:55.181
This will require you
to use your worst skill.

01:14:59.018 --> 01:15:00.019
- [groans]

01:15:00.019 --> 01:15:02.221
[gagging]

01:15:03.456 --> 01:15:05.591
[chorus vocalizing]

01:15:09.495 --> 01:15:11.030
I believe in you!

01:15:22.074 --> 01:15:23.476
[gasps]

01:15:28.514 --> 01:15:30.916
- He's not going to move.

01:15:30.916 --> 01:15:32.852
He trusts me.

01:15:34.887 --> 01:15:37.490
He'll wait for me
to defeat you.

01:15:37.490 --> 01:15:40.693
Oh, but he did try to help you.

01:15:40.693 --> 01:15:42.228
- [groans]

01:15:42.228 --> 01:15:43.996
Stop talking!

01:15:50.703 --> 01:15:51.871
[grunts]

01:16:02.248 --> 01:16:03.883
[chorus continues]

01:17:01.106 --> 01:17:02.141
- [gasps]

01:17:05.878 --> 01:17:07.012
- [gasps]

01:17:09.214 --> 01:17:11.984
You think this is
enough to contain me?!

01:17:16.055 --> 01:17:17.656
Noble...

01:17:19.358 --> 01:17:21.727
Phantasm!

01:17:23.929 --> 01:17:25.331
- Bring it on!

01:17:35.641 --> 01:17:38.143
- Now projection start.

01:17:38.143 --> 01:17:40.012
Searching.

01:17:40.012 --> 01:17:41.280
Select.

01:17:41.280 --> 01:17:42.715
Analyze.

01:17:47.920 --> 01:17:50.956
I am the bone of my sword.

01:17:53.058 --> 01:17:54.927
Rho...

01:17:54.927 --> 01:17:56.261
- Ex...

01:17:59.231 --> 01:18:00.766
- Aias!

01:18:02.301 --> 01:18:04.370
- ...calibur!

01:18:08.140 --> 01:18:10.342
[chorus continues]

01:18:14.980 --> 01:18:16.949
- [wailing]

01:18:20.719 --> 01:18:21.820
- Bellero...

01:18:24.657 --> 01:18:27.159
phon!

01:18:27.159 --> 01:18:29.228
- [neighs]

01:19:00.859 --> 01:19:02.027
[crackling]

01:19:02.027 --> 01:19:03.996
- [groaning]

01:19:08.400 --> 01:19:09.868
[sighs]

01:19:14.239 --> 01:19:15.407
[gasps]

01:19:15.407 --> 01:19:17.142
Shirou?

01:19:30.355 --> 01:19:33.392
- Thank you, Saber,

01:19:33.392 --> 01:19:35.828
for all the times you saved me.

01:19:43.102 --> 01:19:44.837
[gasps]

01:19:57.916 --> 01:19:59.418
I'll go on ahead.

01:19:59.418 --> 01:20:01.820
Catch up when you can run again.

01:20:05.958 --> 01:20:08.393
- [chuckles] Full of surprises.

01:20:08.393 --> 01:20:11.096
You work people
harder than expected.

01:20:11.096 --> 01:20:12.965
[footsteps echoing]

01:20:28.847 --> 01:20:29.982
- [gasps]

01:20:37.156 --> 01:20:39.324
[dramatic music playing]

01:20:47.266 --> 01:20:50.035
- [roars]

01:20:51.170 --> 01:20:52.137
[Rin grunts]

01:20:55.374 --> 01:20:56.441
Hmph.

01:20:56.441 --> 01:20:57.976
- [gasps] Why, you...

01:21:10.022 --> 01:21:11.190
- [panting]

01:21:28.841 --> 01:21:30.142
- No way.

01:21:34.947 --> 01:21:36.849
How did you...

01:21:36.849 --> 01:21:38.584
- Isn't that obvious?

01:21:39.618 --> 01:21:42.287
This is purely
a contest of power.

01:21:42.287 --> 01:21:44.022
- [gasps]

01:21:44.022 --> 01:21:45.357
Your weapon...

01:21:45.357 --> 01:21:46.992
there's something about it.

01:21:46.992 --> 01:21:50.495
- Do you know
what this is, Sakura?

01:21:50.495 --> 01:21:52.030
Take a look. You're facing off

01:21:52.030 --> 01:21:54.399
against the Jeweled
Sword of Zelretch.

01:21:54.399 --> 01:21:57.970
It connects to an infinite
number of parallel universes

01:21:57.970 --> 01:22:01.273
and channels magical energy
from them all.

01:22:01.273 --> 01:22:02.341
- Uh...

01:22:03.408 --> 01:22:06.144
Sword of Zelretch?

01:22:08.247 --> 01:22:12.217
- Honestly. You've never even
heard the name Zelretch?

01:22:12.217 --> 01:22:13.218
- [growls]

01:22:13.218 --> 01:22:15.287
Don't mock me!

01:22:18.490 --> 01:22:21.159
- No matter how much energy
you've banked up,

01:22:21.159 --> 01:22:23.662
you can only use
so much of it at a time,

01:22:23.662 --> 01:22:26.398
and I can match that easily.

01:22:26.398 --> 01:22:29.234
I only need enough
to defend each attack.

01:22:29.234 --> 01:22:31.970
I can always
draw in more next time.

01:22:37.042 --> 01:22:40.012
You've pooled up
a ludicrous amount of power,

01:22:40.012 --> 01:22:42.681
but in your hands,
it's a complete and utter waste.

01:22:42.681 --> 01:22:43.649
- [gasps]

01:22:53.258 --> 01:22:54.393
- It's not fair.

01:22:57.429 --> 01:22:59.097
- Not fair.
- [grunts]

01:23:06.271 --> 01:23:07.439
- Not fair!

01:23:27.159 --> 01:23:28.260
- [grunts]

01:23:29.428 --> 01:23:31.630
That's all the power
you can manage.

01:23:31.630 --> 01:23:33.332
Have you cooled your head now?

01:23:34.633 --> 01:23:36.601
[woman vocalizing]

01:23:36.601 --> 01:23:38.437
- It's not fair.

01:23:38.437 --> 01:23:40.439
How could you?

01:23:40.439 --> 01:23:42.074
How could you?!

01:23:42.074 --> 01:23:45.277
I am your sister, aren't I,
but most of my life,

01:23:45.277 --> 01:23:47.612
I haven't even been treated
like I'm human!

01:23:47.612 --> 01:23:51.116
Makiri's Magecraft
was carved into me.

01:23:51.116 --> 01:23:54.019
All of my meals were poisoned.

01:23:54.019 --> 01:23:59.057
Eating was painful,
and worse, it terrified me!

01:23:59.057 --> 01:24:03.595
In the worm pit, I needed to ask
for permission to even breathe.

01:24:03.595 --> 01:24:05.697
[sobs] Whenever I cried,

01:24:05.697 --> 01:24:09.768
they would only rejoice as they
kept on violating my body!

01:24:11.303 --> 01:24:15.440
Meanwhile, you were
always shining so bright.

01:24:15.440 --> 01:24:18.210
Growing up,
everything was easy for you,

01:24:18.210 --> 01:24:20.512
and I hated you for it.

01:24:20.512 --> 01:24:22.347
I wanted to win!

01:24:22.347 --> 01:24:26.051
Just once, I wanted
my sister to praise me,

01:24:26.051 --> 01:24:28.353
to tell me I was amazing!

01:24:28.353 --> 01:24:33.258
Because I was born
into the Tohsaka family,

01:24:33.258 --> 01:24:38.363
I always believed you would come
for me one day to rescue me.

01:24:38.363 --> 01:24:40.165
But no.

01:24:40.165 --> 01:24:42.300
You never bothered
with me at all!

01:24:43.335 --> 01:24:46.505
I waited 11 years.

01:24:46.505 --> 01:24:48.473
My life's a disaster.

01:24:49.508 --> 01:24:52.611
But is any of it
really my fault?

01:24:52.611 --> 01:24:54.446
So much pain.

01:24:54.446 --> 01:24:57.549
Every day full of pain! [sobs]

01:24:57.549 --> 01:25:01.086
I didn't want things
to be this way.

01:25:02.154 --> 01:25:03.822
This was all I could do.

01:25:03.822 --> 01:25:05.490
I had no choice!

01:25:09.461 --> 01:25:12.264
- That's a terribly sad story.

01:25:12.264 --> 01:25:13.298
So what?

01:25:16.768 --> 01:25:18.070
- [gasps]

01:25:19.404 --> 01:25:23.141
- I mean, you're not exactly
in pain anymore, are you?

01:25:25.143 --> 01:25:26.278
- [gasps]

01:25:27.412 --> 01:25:28.814
That's my point!

01:25:28.814 --> 01:25:31.516
You don't even care!

01:25:31.516 --> 01:25:35.387
- I'm sorry, but I don't really
understand other people's pain.

01:25:36.455 --> 01:25:38.490
That's how I am.

01:25:38.490 --> 01:25:41.259
No matter what kind of torture
you had to go through,

01:25:41.259 --> 01:25:43.528
I'll never be able to relate.

01:25:43.528 --> 01:25:45.263
- [sighs]

01:25:46.565 --> 01:25:48.700
- But, Sakura...

01:25:48.700 --> 01:25:51.470
even as insensitive
as I happen to be...

01:25:52.737 --> 01:25:56.575
even after hearing you cry
about of your problems,

01:25:56.575 --> 01:25:59.478
I never thought of myself
as being blessed.

01:26:01.246 --> 01:26:02.714
- [gasps]

01:26:07.886 --> 01:26:09.354
How dare you?

01:26:11.756 --> 01:26:13.692
You were!

01:26:13.692 --> 01:26:15.527
How can you say that?!

01:26:17.295 --> 01:26:18.797
- Sakura...

01:26:22.701 --> 01:26:24.436
- [gasps]

01:26:27.339 --> 01:26:28.640
- Welt, Ende.

01:26:30.542 --> 01:26:32.310
- [gasping]

01:26:34.579 --> 01:26:36.481
[spines snapping]

01:26:44.523 --> 01:26:46.491
[childlike music playing]

01:26:59.304 --> 01:27:00.272
- Mm.

01:27:01.306 --> 01:27:02.774
[gasps]

01:27:02.774 --> 01:27:04.576
[giggles]

01:27:10.649 --> 01:27:11.883
[giggles]

01:27:13.718 --> 01:27:15.220
[giggles]

01:27:16.521 --> 01:27:17.589
- [sighs]

01:27:22.761 --> 01:27:25.363
Oh. This isn't good.

01:27:31.436 --> 01:27:33.405
- [shuddering]

01:27:36.841 --> 01:27:38.310
[winces]

01:27:39.644 --> 01:27:41.913
Big Sister?

01:27:46.618 --> 01:27:47.586
[gasps]

01:27:50.355 --> 01:27:52.657
- I'm a complete idiot.

01:27:52.657 --> 01:27:55.327
But I can't stand it

01:27:55.327 --> 01:27:58.496
when people try their hardest
and end up with nothing.

01:27:58.496 --> 01:28:00.532
I really do love you, Sakura.

01:28:01.766 --> 01:28:03.568
I've always wanted
to see you smile.

01:28:05.670 --> 01:28:07.672
- [gasps]

01:28:07.672 --> 01:28:11.243
- I wanted to believe
that as long as I suffered,

01:28:11.243 --> 01:28:14.813
it would only make your life
that much easier.

01:28:16.381 --> 01:28:20.485
I guess I can't really
criticize Shirou, can I?

01:28:20.485 --> 01:28:21.953
[knife clatters]

01:28:24.489 --> 01:28:25.957
Once I saw you up close,

01:28:25.957 --> 01:28:28.827
I realized that I
really couldn't kill you.

01:28:30.295 --> 01:28:32.030
I'm sorry.

01:28:32.030 --> 01:28:35.300
I'm a selfish big sister.

01:28:35.300 --> 01:28:38.270
But I'm happy, because...

01:28:38.270 --> 01:28:42.574
you've been wearing that ribbon
all this time.

01:28:42.574 --> 01:28:43.541
- [gasps]

01:28:50.649 --> 01:28:51.650
[gasps]

01:29:08.066 --> 01:29:09.734
[gasps]

01:29:09.734 --> 01:29:12.070
She loves me?

01:29:14.439 --> 01:29:17.876
I've been waiting
to hear her say that.

01:29:19.444 --> 01:29:21.446
[gasps]

01:29:21.446 --> 01:29:22.881
But now...

01:29:23.948 --> 01:29:25.350
I killed her.

01:29:25.350 --> 01:29:26.718
She's gone.

01:29:29.688 --> 01:29:32.490
[crying]

01:29:36.961 --> 01:29:38.930
[wailing]

01:29:45.570 --> 01:29:47.539
[crying]

01:29:51.109 --> 01:29:53.812
- [footsteps approaching]
- [gasps]

01:30:01.353 --> 01:30:03.555
Oh. Shirou.

01:30:06.024 --> 01:30:07.959
- [gasps]

01:30:09.494 --> 01:30:11.463
[rumbling]

01:30:14.999 --> 01:30:17.769
- [gasping]

01:30:19.070 --> 01:30:20.672
- [gasps]

01:30:20.672 --> 01:30:21.940
- She's dead.

01:30:21.940 --> 01:30:25.543
- Hmm?
- I-I killed her!

01:30:25.543 --> 01:30:28.947
[crying] My sister, she's gone.

01:30:28.947 --> 01:30:31.483
She always told me
not to give up,

01:30:31.483 --> 01:30:33.952
but I was too stupid
to understand!

01:30:33.952 --> 01:30:36.988
I hate this!

01:30:36.988 --> 01:30:39.758
Now I have to stop it!

01:30:41.126 --> 01:30:42.761
[rumbling]

01:30:44.796 --> 01:30:47.031
- Nice job, Tohsaka.

01:30:47.031 --> 01:30:48.666
You just won.

01:30:51.102 --> 01:30:55.073
Sakura, Tohsaka's still alive!

01:30:55.073 --> 01:30:56.841
- [gasps]

01:30:56.841 --> 01:30:58.910
It's not too late.

01:30:58.910 --> 01:31:00.912
You and I can save her together!

01:31:01.946 --> 01:31:03.915
- [gasping]

01:31:09.587 --> 01:31:11.423
[gasps]

01:31:11.423 --> 01:31:14.092
Oh, no!
You have to get away from here!

01:31:18.930 --> 01:31:21.833
- [scraping]
- [grunts]

01:31:21.833 --> 01:31:22.834
[gasps]

01:31:22.834 --> 01:31:24.602
- No, that's--

01:31:24.602 --> 01:31:26.738
I don't want to do this.

01:31:26.738 --> 01:31:27.839
Get away!

01:31:27.839 --> 01:31:29.507
- Yeah, I know,

01:31:29.507 --> 01:31:32.110
but that little brat's
being a sore loser!

01:31:37.148 --> 01:31:38.450
- [gasps]

01:31:42.987 --> 01:31:44.556
[gasps]

01:31:48.193 --> 01:31:51.796
Shirou, take my sister,
and get out of here!

01:31:57.469 --> 01:31:59.237
- [gasping]

01:32:01.105 --> 01:32:02.207
[sighs]

01:32:03.241 --> 01:32:04.209
- [grunts]

01:32:11.516 --> 01:32:14.586
- [groans]
I can't hold it back.

01:32:15.687 --> 01:32:17.889
Go now, please!

01:32:17.889 --> 01:32:18.857
- [gasps]

01:32:23.528 --> 01:32:25.530
- Please stop this!

01:32:25.530 --> 01:32:28.700
Let me go!
I can die here alone!

01:32:28.700 --> 01:32:30.702
I don't want you to see this!

01:32:30.702 --> 01:32:32.270
Let me die!

01:32:32.270 --> 01:32:34.506
- [yells]

01:32:40.645 --> 01:32:42.780
- Why won't you stop?

01:32:42.780 --> 01:32:45.083
I don't deserve to be saved.

01:32:45.083 --> 01:32:48.620
No, I shouldn't be saved at all!

01:32:57.829 --> 01:32:58.897
- Hang on!

01:32:58.897 --> 01:33:00.031
- [gasps]

01:33:05.970 --> 01:33:07.939
[rumbling]

01:33:13.278 --> 01:33:14.979
- Sakura.

01:33:14.979 --> 01:33:16.147
- [whimpers]

01:33:24.322 --> 01:33:26.724
You see, Shirou?

01:33:26.724 --> 01:33:28.326
That's what I mean.

01:33:28.326 --> 01:33:32.897
I--This is what I
have become now,

01:33:32.897 --> 01:33:34.232
so just go!

01:33:35.600 --> 01:33:36.834
[gasps]

01:33:43.608 --> 01:33:44.976
Look at me.

01:33:44.976 --> 01:33:47.845
I've killed so many people--

01:33:47.845 --> 01:33:51.583
my brother, Grandfather,

01:33:51.583 --> 01:33:53.751
and now even my big sister!

01:33:54.819 --> 01:33:58.222
So tell me,
do I really deserve to live

01:33:58.222 --> 01:34:00.592
after the terrible things
I've done?!

01:34:00.592 --> 01:34:01.659
- You do!

01:34:01.659 --> 01:34:04.629
Can't you see?

01:34:04.629 --> 01:34:05.997
You took their lives.

01:34:05.997 --> 01:34:07.765
Now take responsibility!

01:34:14.172 --> 01:34:16.608
- Shirou, you...

01:34:16.608 --> 01:34:18.142
[gasps]

01:34:18.142 --> 01:34:20.945
[scraping]

01:34:20.945 --> 01:34:21.879
[whimpering]

01:34:26.718 --> 01:34:30.722
- I don't know your sins
or your punishment.

01:34:30.722 --> 01:34:32.957
I've no idea what they are.

01:34:32.957 --> 01:34:36.094
But I'll protect you
from everything,

01:34:36.094 --> 01:34:38.296
everything that's
coming for you, Sakura.

01:34:38.296 --> 01:34:40.098
I'll be right there!

01:34:41.165 --> 01:34:44.769
And sure,
that may be hypocritical...

01:34:44.769 --> 01:34:47.905
but I will defend
the one I love!

01:34:50.775 --> 01:34:53.244
Now trace on.

01:34:57.315 --> 01:34:59.317
Time for your punishment.

01:35:00.685 --> 01:35:03.121
It's not going to to be easy.

01:35:03.121 --> 01:35:04.989
You better grit your teeth.

01:35:04.989 --> 01:35:06.958
[music playing]

01:35:15.967 --> 01:35:16.934
- Okay.

01:35:27.278 --> 01:35:29.981
- Let's go home, Sakura.

01:35:29.981 --> 01:35:32.050
Cut your ties with this thing.

01:35:38.189 --> 01:35:40.158
[chimes ringing]

01:36:30.942 --> 01:36:32.977
[rumbling]

01:36:37.815 --> 01:36:40.451
It won't stop, will it?

01:36:45.456 --> 01:36:47.425
- [chittering]

01:36:51.262 --> 01:36:52.964
- [sighs]

01:37:01.038 --> 01:37:03.040
[sighs]

01:37:03.040 --> 01:37:05.042
- Shirou.
- Eh?

01:37:07.078 --> 01:37:09.280
Oh, uh, it's you.

01:37:09.280 --> 01:37:11.182
Perfect timing.

01:37:11.182 --> 01:37:14.452
Can you help
take Sakura and Tohsaka

01:37:14.452 --> 01:37:16.220
and get them out
of this place?

01:37:16.220 --> 01:37:18.456
Um...

01:37:18.456 --> 01:37:20.958
R-Ri...

01:37:23.961 --> 01:37:25.463
- Yes, of course.

01:37:30.101 --> 01:37:31.068
- Thank you.

01:37:32.270 --> 01:37:34.305
Oh, and...

01:37:34.305 --> 01:37:36.574
[groans]

01:37:36.574 --> 01:37:40.244
Can you give this to Sakura?

01:37:42.446 --> 01:37:45.316
- No, Shirou. Do that yourself.

01:37:49.020 --> 01:37:51.022
[sighs]

01:37:51.022 --> 01:37:52.123
Fine.

01:37:52.123 --> 01:37:54.025
Good luck.

01:38:03.434 --> 01:38:06.304
[ominous music playing]

01:38:11.342 --> 01:38:14.045
[rumbling]

01:38:14.045 --> 01:38:15.880
- [sighs]

01:38:35.499 --> 01:38:37.268
Kotomine?

01:38:37.268 --> 01:38:38.870
It's you.

01:38:38.870 --> 01:38:41.906
- Yes. And it seems...

01:38:41.906 --> 01:38:45.276
you and I are both
barely clinging to life,

01:38:45.276 --> 01:38:48.279
Shirou Emiya.

01:38:52.550 --> 01:38:57.555
- Even if this thing gets out,
your wish will never be granted.

01:38:57.555 --> 01:39:00.458
- But that is my wish.

01:39:00.458 --> 01:39:03.427
I have but only
one objective here,

01:39:03.427 --> 01:39:04.595
and that is to ensure

01:39:04.595 --> 01:39:07.164
the successful birth
of this curse.

01:39:07.164 --> 01:39:11.602
- But why?
Why are you protecting it?

01:39:11.602 --> 01:39:14.372
It's evil,
the definition of the word.

01:39:14.372 --> 01:39:17.575
- It is not evil yet,

01:39:17.575 --> 01:39:20.077
nor is it good.

01:39:20.077 --> 01:39:22.680
Humans become
either good or evil

01:39:22.680 --> 01:39:25.416
through the process
of learning,

01:39:25.416 --> 01:39:28.152
but they begin at zero.

01:39:28.152 --> 01:39:29.220
- [gasps]

01:39:29.220 --> 01:39:30.488
- At the start,

01:39:30.488 --> 01:39:34.125
the only truth they know
is the existence of truth.

01:39:34.125 --> 01:39:35.226
[chuckles]

01:39:39.964 --> 01:39:43.267
Humans are capable
of good and evil.

01:39:43.267 --> 01:39:46.470
It's up to the individual
to determine the difference.

01:39:46.470 --> 01:39:49.407
There is no crime
in one's birth.

01:39:49.407 --> 01:39:53.177
There's a life longing
to be born into the world.

01:39:53.177 --> 01:39:56.147
Allowing that miracle
to happen is love.

01:39:57.248 --> 01:39:59.417
- What a crock of shit.

01:39:59.417 --> 01:40:03.354
- That's what it means to me,
Shirou Emiya.

01:40:04.655 --> 01:40:08.292
You find your bliss in seeing
the happiness of others.

01:40:09.327 --> 01:40:14.265
I can only find mine
in witnessing their suffering.

01:40:26.277 --> 01:40:28.245
[metal rings]

01:40:28.245 --> 01:40:30.514
- [both groan]
- [chorus vocalizing]

01:40:32.984 --> 01:40:33.985
- [yells]

01:40:42.493 --> 01:40:44.562
- That body of yours
is troublesome.

01:40:44.562 --> 01:40:48.232
Whoever attacks it
risks their own life.

01:40:48.232 --> 01:40:49.467
- [yells]

01:40:59.210 --> 01:41:00.444
- [gasps]
- [grunts]

01:41:02.279 --> 01:41:06.484
Tell me, who are you to say
that all killing is evil?

01:41:06.484 --> 01:41:10.187
You're protecting Sakura Matou,
the murderer, aren't you?!

01:41:10.187 --> 01:41:11.188
[running footsteps]

01:41:15.726 --> 01:41:19.063
- How quintessentially human
of you.

01:41:19.063 --> 01:41:22.199
Evil men occasionally flirt
with goodwill,

01:41:22.199 --> 01:41:25.503
and saints willfully
commit sins on a whim.

01:41:25.503 --> 01:41:30.574
It is this contradiction
that makes us human.

01:41:30.574 --> 01:41:32.643
To live is to harbor both.

01:41:32.643 --> 01:41:35.379
Good and evil
coexist in us all.

01:41:35.379 --> 01:41:36.480
[clatter]

01:41:39.316 --> 01:41:40.618
- [gasps]

01:41:43.087 --> 01:41:47.091
This thing only exists
to kill everything it touches!

01:41:47.091 --> 01:41:49.493
- [grunts] Yes. That's right!

01:41:49.493 --> 01:41:52.063
But we don't know
how it feels about that.

01:41:52.063 --> 01:41:55.232
That's what I want,
to learn its true nature!

01:41:55.232 --> 01:41:59.570
Will it lament its evil actions
or laugh them off?

01:41:59.570 --> 01:42:02.373
If it has no doubts
about its function,

01:42:02.373 --> 01:42:05.376
when it was humanity who wished
for it to be what it is,

01:42:05.376 --> 01:42:08.279
it cannot be evil!

01:42:08.279 --> 01:42:09.613
- [gasps]

01:42:09.613 --> 01:42:11.182
[gags]

01:42:11.182 --> 01:42:13.084
- When its life begins,

01:42:13.084 --> 01:42:16.320
it will kill everything,
just as it was asked.

01:42:16.320 --> 01:42:20.257
When it stands alone
as the sole survivor,

01:42:20.257 --> 01:42:23.861
will it be able to forgive
itself for what it's done?

01:42:23.861 --> 01:42:28.365
That is exactly
what I'm dying to know.

01:42:31.735 --> 01:42:34.171
- That's the lame wish
that you want granted?

01:42:34.171 --> 01:42:36.474
That's your excuse?!

01:42:36.474 --> 01:42:37.808
- [gasps]

01:42:44.315 --> 01:42:46.383
[grunts]

01:42:49.520 --> 01:42:53.891
An excuse? Nothing else
in the world matters to me.

01:42:53.891 --> 01:42:55.893
Do you understand?

01:42:55.893 --> 01:42:58.262
You and I are
on opposite extremes,

01:42:58.262 --> 01:43:00.431
because you want
nothing for yourself.

01:43:00.431 --> 01:43:02.466
You only think of others.

01:43:02.466 --> 01:43:03.567
- [grunts]

01:43:03.567 --> 01:43:06.337
- However, our desires
are very similar!

01:43:10.374 --> 01:43:12.343
[both grunting]

01:43:14.178 --> 01:43:16.514
- [Kirei yells]
- [groans]

01:43:16.514 --> 01:43:18.382
- [snarls]

01:43:18.382 --> 01:43:19.717
- [gags]

01:43:19.717 --> 01:43:21.719
[chorus vocalizing]

01:43:21.719 --> 01:43:23.220
[gags]

01:43:23.220 --> 01:43:25.189
[panting]

01:43:28.159 --> 01:43:30.494
Oh, I get it.

01:43:30.494 --> 01:43:35.733
We're similar because we both
think of ourselves as sinners.

01:43:35.733 --> 01:43:38.335
But we both chose our path,

01:43:38.335 --> 01:43:41.172
looking for salvation
that would never come.

01:43:45.910 --> 01:43:49.747
You'll never back down,
will you?

01:43:51.715 --> 01:43:55.886
I also have to admit
I'm taking out my anger.

01:43:55.886 --> 01:44:00.291
I envy you people
for what I could never have.

01:44:00.291 --> 01:44:02.593
- Seems fair.

01:44:02.593 --> 01:44:05.496
I guess talking
was a waste of time.

01:44:05.496 --> 01:44:07.831
- I don't mind.

01:44:07.831 --> 01:44:10.801
Neither of us
has much time left anyway.

01:44:21.712 --> 01:44:23.681
[Zouken gasping]

01:44:25.849 --> 01:44:29.753
I don't want to die.

01:44:29.753 --> 01:44:33.324
[groans] I don't want to die.

01:44:33.324 --> 01:44:34.692
I don't...

01:44:39.563 --> 01:44:41.732
JUSTEAZE:
I ask you, my mortal enemy...

01:44:41.732 --> 01:44:43.267
- [gasps]

01:44:43.267 --> 01:44:46.303
- why do you wish
so fiercely not to die?

01:44:54.912 --> 01:44:58.315
ZELRETCH: You want
all forms of evil eradicated.

01:44:58.315 --> 01:45:02.253
To do this,
you sought out a miracle.

01:45:04.655 --> 01:45:07.024
- There is no salvation
in this world.

01:45:07.024 --> 01:45:08.592
As long as we're human,

01:45:08.592 --> 01:45:10.995
we cannot
be separated from evil.

01:45:14.431 --> 01:45:17.501
- We seek utopia,
but we know that it lies

01:45:17.501 --> 01:45:20.771
in a place that can
never be reached by humans.

01:45:20.771 --> 01:45:24.008
- We wish to surpass humans,

01:45:24.008 --> 01:45:27.578
to discover
a new shape of humanity.

01:45:27.578 --> 01:45:33.284
ALL: Yes. In order to eliminate
all the evil of this world,

01:45:33.284 --> 01:45:38.756
we promise we will risk our
lives to achieve this dream.

01:45:43.527 --> 01:45:45.362
ZOUKEIt's been 500 years,

01:45:45.362 --> 01:45:49.833
but, looking back, that desire
only lasted an instant.

01:45:53.604 --> 01:45:58.742
Disappointing. To think
I was just one step short.

01:46:11.622 --> 01:46:14.024
[rumbling]

01:46:14.024 --> 01:46:15.793
KIREI: It's over.

01:46:15.793 --> 01:46:19.096
It appears it was
a game of inches.

01:46:20.331 --> 01:46:21.398
- [gasps]

01:46:26.036 --> 01:46:29.406
- You are
the last remaining Master.

01:46:29.406 --> 01:46:32.509
Go and fulfill
your sacred obligations

01:47:01.905 --> 01:47:03.807
- This is it.

01:47:03.807 --> 01:47:06.543
This will be the end.

01:47:06.543 --> 01:47:08.145
One more projection.

01:47:17.121 --> 01:47:19.556
[spikes rattling]

01:47:19.556 --> 01:47:20.958
But wait.

01:47:22.159 --> 01:47:24.895
Is that really the way?

01:47:29.533 --> 01:47:30.601
[spikes rattling]

01:47:30.601 --> 01:47:32.936
[shudders]

01:47:32.936 --> 01:47:34.405
- ILLYA: No.
- [gasps]

01:47:34.405 --> 01:47:36.607
- You won't die here, Shirou.

01:47:36.607 --> 01:47:38.409
[sentimental music playing]

01:47:45.783 --> 01:47:48.452
I'm the one that's
going to close the gate.

01:47:49.720 --> 01:47:53.490
Shirou, tell me,

01:47:53.490 --> 01:47:55.826
do you want to keep on living?

01:47:56.860 --> 01:47:59.763
In whatever form you can hold?

01:48:02.833 --> 01:48:05.436
Do you want to live?

01:48:05.436 --> 01:48:07.671
- [gasping]

01:48:07.671 --> 01:48:10.441
No. I--

01:48:10.441 --> 01:48:12.943
I have to...

01:48:12.943 --> 01:48:15.479
take it down with me.

01:48:15.479 --> 01:48:18.782
Don't worry. Please.

01:48:21.151 --> 01:48:22.219
- Do you?

01:48:24.087 --> 01:48:25.189
- [gasps]

01:48:26.223 --> 01:48:28.225
- [spikes rattling]
- [crying]

01:48:34.031 --> 01:48:35.199
I do.

01:48:37.100 --> 01:48:39.203
I do! I wanna live!

01:48:42.105 --> 01:48:44.208
- I'm so glad.

01:48:46.844 --> 01:48:49.580
- [gasps]

01:48:49.580 --> 01:48:52.749
No, wait. Come back.

01:48:54.151 --> 01:48:56.253
- I'm going to show you
a miracle,

01:48:56.253 --> 01:48:58.655
and this one will be amazing.

01:48:59.690 --> 01:49:01.525
Watch closely now.

01:49:01.525 --> 01:49:04.228
You're about to see
real magic.

01:49:04.228 --> 01:49:05.796
- I don't care.

01:49:05.796 --> 01:49:09.600
Please! Please just come back!

01:49:11.168 --> 01:49:12.669
Damn it.

01:49:12.669 --> 01:49:14.104
What's your name?

01:49:14.104 --> 01:49:16.139
I don't remember.

01:49:20.844 --> 01:49:24.781
- You told me a big brother
protects his little sister.

01:49:24.781 --> 01:49:26.717
- [gasps]

01:49:30.120 --> 01:49:34.791
- Well, I'm really
your big sister, Shirou.

01:49:34.791 --> 01:49:38.962
Which means I have
to protect my little brother.

01:49:39.997 --> 01:49:41.798
- [sobbing]

01:49:41.798 --> 01:49:42.799
Illya!

01:49:48.906 --> 01:49:50.574
Illya!

01:49:50.574 --> 01:49:53.310
Illya! Illya!

01:49:53.310 --> 01:49:54.711
Illya!

01:49:54.711 --> 01:49:57.548
Illya! Illya!

01:49:57.548 --> 01:50:00.083
Illya!

01:50:01.118 --> 01:50:02.686
[slam echoes]

01:50:07.758 --> 01:50:09.726
[energy humming]

01:50:24.041 --> 01:50:26.143
- [gasps]

01:50:26.143 --> 01:50:28.111
[sighs]

01:50:28.111 --> 01:50:30.080
[laughing]

01:50:34.985 --> 01:50:36.954
[sentimental music playing]

01:50:44.962 --> 01:50:46.930
[rumbling]

01:51:41.284 --> 01:51:43.286
[energy humming]

01:51:51.762 --> 01:51:53.063
- [groans]

01:51:56.967 --> 01:51:59.903
Is that Shirou?

01:52:06.043 --> 01:52:08.011
[insects buzzing]

01:52:31.902 --> 01:52:32.903
[releases arrow]

01:52:34.104 --> 01:52:37.240
- Well, that's our
next team captain for you.

01:52:37.240 --> 01:52:40.043
It looks like
I can rest easy when I retire.

01:52:42.012 --> 01:52:42.979
[sighs]

01:52:45.482 --> 01:52:48.251
[sentimental music playing]

01:52:48.251 --> 01:52:51.154
Why is it taking him
so long to come back?

01:53:08.238 --> 01:53:11.475
RIN: The Holy Grail War
has finally come to an end.

01:53:13.009 --> 01:53:15.378
The Greater Grail
has been destroyed,

01:53:15.378 --> 01:53:17.280
and it took the war with it.

01:53:19.149 --> 01:53:20.817
I had to deal with the fallout

01:53:20.817 --> 01:53:22.819
caused with
the Mage's Association

01:53:22.819 --> 01:53:25.756
while I waited
for Sakura to recover.

01:53:28.825 --> 01:53:32.229
Now I'm back, and I'm
walking alongside her...

01:53:34.097 --> 01:53:36.833
making up for 11 years
of lost time.

01:53:37.868 --> 01:53:40.337
And time is moving again.

01:53:40.337 --> 01:53:43.306
At least we're together now.

01:53:43.306 --> 01:53:46.843
Although
he's not around anymore.

01:53:48.044 --> 01:53:53.183
Because Shirou Emiya's body
disintegrated.

01:54:00.490 --> 01:54:02.459
[birds chirping]

01:54:25.382 --> 01:54:27.350
[chopping vegetables]

01:54:31.388 --> 01:54:33.156
- [door slides]
- [gasps]

01:54:34.191 --> 01:54:36.193
- Sakura...

01:54:36.193 --> 01:54:37.594
Rin's just come back home.

01:54:37.594 --> 01:54:38.562
- [chirps]

01:54:39.596 --> 01:54:43.099
- [gasps] That's great.

01:54:43.099 --> 01:54:44.467
Thanks, Rider.

01:54:46.903 --> 01:54:48.271
- [sighs]

01:54:48.271 --> 01:54:51.241
So, Sakura, how have you been?

01:54:51.241 --> 01:54:55.378
- Good.
It's been a slow process,

01:54:55.378 --> 01:54:57.280
but I think
I'm finally in a place

01:54:57.280 --> 01:54:59.583
where I can accept things
for what they are.

01:54:59.583 --> 01:55:03.019
If I let myself
be crushed by guilt,

01:55:03.019 --> 01:55:05.322
it's the same as running away.

01:55:06.423 --> 01:55:08.592
- [sighs]

01:55:08.592 --> 01:55:10.560
[birds chirping]

01:55:14.297 --> 01:55:16.233
SAKURThings that have changed

01:55:16.233 --> 01:55:18.568
and things that need to change.

01:55:20.237 --> 01:55:24.107
But I wonder how I'll tell
if something has or not?

01:55:24.107 --> 01:55:27.010
Hard to say right now.

01:55:27.010 --> 01:55:29.246
I'm still looking for a path.

01:55:31.348 --> 01:55:32.382
And yet...

01:55:50.400 --> 01:55:52.903
[creaks]

01:55:52.903 --> 01:55:54.604
[both gasp]

01:56:01.211 --> 01:56:04.214
SAKURA: In a world
that never stops changing...

01:56:06.249 --> 01:56:07.584
[door slides]

01:56:07.584 --> 01:56:10.120
some things
always stay the same.

01:56:17.060 --> 01:56:18.028
[gasps]

01:56:27.103 --> 01:56:28.171
- Eh?

01:56:28.171 --> 01:56:30.674
Sakura, what's wrong?

01:56:30.674 --> 01:56:33.043
- [sighs]

01:56:33.043 --> 01:56:34.611
[stifles crying]

01:56:36.947 --> 01:56:37.948
Nothing.

01:56:41.284 --> 01:56:42.652
TAIGA: Hey, come on! Let's go!

01:56:42.652 --> 01:56:45.522
SHIROU: Jeez, are you
a little kid or what?

01:56:46.723 --> 01:56:47.691
RIN: Hey...

01:56:54.497 --> 01:56:57.133
Sakura, are you happy?

01:56:58.168 --> 01:57:00.136
[wind blowing]

01:57:08.411 --> 01:57:09.612
- Yes.

01:57:12.549 --> 01:57:15.085
- [chuckles]

01:57:21.157 --> 01:57:23.126
- [soft music playing]
- [singing in Japanese]

01:58:01.264 --> 01:58:03.233
[music playing only]

01:58:41.237 --> 01:58:42.605
[song continues]
